f cis,cis-3,6-Dodecadienoyl-CoA to form trans,cis-Lauro-2,6-dienoyl-CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-109338\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-109338.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 9997066, \"displayName\": \"Isomerization of cis,cis-3,6-Dodecadienoyl-CoA to form trans,cis-Lauro-2,6-dienoyl-CoA\", \"inferredFrom\": [109338], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Isomerization of cis,cis-3,6-Dodecadienoyl-CoA to form trans,cis-Lauro-2,6-dienoyl-CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-109338\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-109338.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 77360, \"displayName\": \"trans,cis-Lauro-2,6-dienoyl-CoA  [mitochondrial matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"trans,cis-Lauro-2,6-dienoyl-CoA \", \"(2-trans,6-cis)-dodeca-2,6-dienoyl-CoA\"], \"producedByEvent\": [109338], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-77360\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-77360.3\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"omitted\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 109339, \"displayName\": \"Linoleoyl-CoA is converted to cis,cis-3,6- dodecadienoyl-CoA by three cycles of beta-oxidation\", \"followingEvent\": [109338], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Linoleoyl-CoA is converted to cis,cis-3,6- dodecadienoyl-CoA by three cycles of beta-oxidation\", \"Removal of six carbons from Linoleoyl-CoA to form cis,cis-3,6- Dodecadienoyl-CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2004-07-06\", \"schemaClass\": \"BlackBoxEvent\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-109339\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-109339.4\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2004-07-06\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-109338\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-109338.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 178921, \"displayName\": \"At the beginning of this reaction, 1 molecule of 'cis,cis-3,...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"At the beginning of this reaction, 1 molecule of 'cis,cis-3,6-Dodecadienoyl-CoA' is present. At the end of this reaction, 1 molecule of 'trans,cis-Lauro-2,6-dienoyl-CoA ' is present.<br><br> This reaction takes place in the 'mitochondrial matrix' and  is mediated by the 'dodecenoyl-CoA delta-isomerase activity' of '3,2-trans-enoyl-CoA isomerase Homodimer'.<br>\"}]}" ;
