d to PG by LPGAT\", \"inferredFrom\": [1482635], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"2-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by LPGAT\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-1482635\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-1482635.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10384680, \"displayName\": \"2-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by LPGAT\", \"inferredFrom\": [1482635], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"2-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by LPGAT\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-1482635\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-1482635.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10161490, \"displayName\": \"2-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by LPGAT\", \"inferredFrom\": [1482635], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"2-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by LPGAT\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-1482635\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-1482635.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10039104, \"displayName\": \"2-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by LPGAT\", \"inferredFrom\": [1482635], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"2-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by LPGAT\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-1482635\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-1482635.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 1483256, \"displayName\": \"PG [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PG\", \"1,2-diacyl-sn-glycero-3-phospho-(1'-sn-glycerol)(1-)\", \"phosphatidylglycerol\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1482635], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-1483256\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1483256.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 76194, \"displayName\": \"CoA-SH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CoA-SH\", \"coenzyme A(4-)\", \"coenzyme A\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1482635], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-76194\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-76194.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1482920, \"displayName\": \"PG is hydrolyzed to 2-acyl LPG by PLA2[14]\", \"followingEvent\": [1482635], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PG is hydrolyzed to 2-acyl LPG by PLA2[14]\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1482920\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1482920.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1482635\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1482635.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 1482586, \"displayName\": \"At the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) membrane, lysophospholipid...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"At the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) membrane, lysophospholipid acyltransferases acylate 2-acyl lysophosphatidylglycerol (LPG) to form phosphatidylglycerol (PG).  The lysophospholipid acyltransferases involved are: lysophosphatidylcholine acyltransferase 1 (LPCAT1) (Nakanishi et al. 2006, Chen et al. 2006), lysophospholipid acyltransferase LPCAT4 (LPCAT4) aka LPEAT2 (Cao et al. 2008, Ye et al. 2005); or acyl-CoA:lysophosphatidylglycerol acyltransferase (LPGAT1) (Yang et al. 2004).\"}]}" ;
