 reticulum membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PE\", \"phosphatidylethanolamine zwitterion\", \"phosphatidylethanolamine\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1482667], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-1500581\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1500581.6\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 76194, \"displayName\": \"CoA-SH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CoA-SH\", \"coenzyme A(4-)\", \"coenzyme A\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1482667], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-76194\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-76194.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1482884, \"displayName\": \"PE is hydrolyzed to 1-acyl LPE by PLA2[2]\", \"followingEvent\": [1482667], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PE is hydrolyzed to 1-acyl LPE by PLA2[2]\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1482884\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1482884.2\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1482887, \"displayName\": \"PE is hydrolyzed to 1-acyl LPE by PLA2[3]\", \"followingEvent\": [1482667], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PE is hydrolyzed to 1-acyl LPE by PLA2[3]\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1482887\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1482887.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1482667\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1482667.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 1482538, \"displayName\": \"At the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) membrane, lysophospholipid...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"At the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) membrane, lysophospholipid acyltransferases acylate 1-acyl lysophosphatidylethanolamine (LPE) to form phosphatidylethanolamine (PE).  The lysophospholipid acyltransferases involved are: lysophospholipid acyltransferase 1 (MBOAT1) aka LPEAT1 (Gijon et al. 2008, Hishikawa et al. 2008); lysophospholipid acyltransferase LPCAT4 (LPCAT4) aka LPEAT2 (Cao et al. 2008, Ye et al., 2005); lysophospholipid acyltransferase 2 (MBOAT2) aka LPCAT4 (Hishikawa et al. 2008, Gijon et al. 2008); lysophospholipid acyltransferase 5 (LPCAT3) (Hishikawa et al. 2008, Zhao et al. 2008, Gijon et al. 2008, Jain et al. 2009, Kazachkov et al. 2008).\"}]}" ;
