alcium-independent phospholipase A2 gene multiple enzymes with distinct properties from a single gene\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/10336645\", \"volume\": 262, \"year\": 1999}], \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CL is hydrolyzed to MLCL by PLA2G6 (IM)\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 1498773, \"displayName\": \"MLCL [mitochondrial inner membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"MLCL\", \"2-monolysocardiolipin\", \"Monolysocardiolipin\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1482778], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-1498773\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1498773.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 1524085, \"displayName\": \"LCFA(-) [mitochondrial inner membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LCFA(-)\", \"long-chain fatty acid anion\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1482778], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-1524085\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1524085.3\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1483063, \"displayName\": \"PG and CDP-DAG are converted to CL by CRLS1\", \"followingEvent\": [1482778], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PG and CDP-DAG are converted to CL by CRLS1\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1483063\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1483063.2\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1482781, \"displayName\": \"MLCL and PC are converted to CL and 1-acyl LPC by TAZ (IM) (Reversible)\", \"followingEvent\": [1482778], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"MLCL and PC are converted to CL and 1-acyl LPC by TAZ (IM) (Reversible)\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012