-sn-glycero-3-phosphoglycerol\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1482847], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-1524047\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1524047.3\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 1524085, \"displayName\": \"LCFA(-) [mitochondrial inner membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LCFA(-)\", \"long-chain fatty acid anion\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1482847], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-1524085\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1524085.3\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1483197, \"displayName\": \"PTPMT1 dephosphorylates PGP to PG\", \"followingEvent\": [1482847], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PTPMT1 dephosphorylates PGP to PG\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1483197\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1483197.2\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1482689, \"displayName\": \"1-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by CRLS1 (IM)\", \"followingEvent\": [1482847], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"1-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by CRLS1 (IM)\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1482689\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1482689.2\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1482546, \"displayName\": \"2-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by CRLS1 (IM)\", \"followingEvent\": [1482847], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"2-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by CRLS1 (IM)\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1482546\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1482546.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1482847\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1482847.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 1482790, \"displayName\": \"At the inner mitochondrial (IR) membrane, phosphatidylglycer...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"At the inner mitochondrial (IR) membrane, phosphatidylglycerol (PG) is hydrolysed, and has one of its acyl chains cleaved off, by phospholipase A2 beta (PLA2G4B) (Ghomashchi et al. 2010) to form 2-acyl lysophosphatidylglycerol (LPG).  Phospholipase A2 enzymes show not only PLA2 hydrolysing activity to form the 1-acyl lysophospholipid but also have a degree of PLA1 activity, producing a 2-acyl lysophospholipid.\"}]}" ;
