e\", \"L-2-Lysophosphatidylethanolamine\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1482850], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-1524089\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1524089.4\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1482778, \"displayName\": \"CL is hydrolyzed to MLCL by PLA2G6 (IM)\", \"followingEvent\": [1482850], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CL is hydrolyzed to MLCL by PLA2G6 (IM)\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1482778\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1482778.2\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1483212, \"displayName\": \"PS is decarboxylated to PE by PISD\", \"followingEvent\": [1482850], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PS is decarboxylated to PE by PISD\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1483212\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1483212.3\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"reverseReaction\": {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1482894, \"displayName\": \"CL and 1-acyl LPE are converted to MLCL and PE by TAZ (IM) (Reversible)\", \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CL and 1-acyl LPE are converted to MLCL and PE by TAZ (IM) (Reversible)\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1482894\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1482894.2\"}, \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1482850\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1482850.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 1482824, \"displayName\": \"At the inner mitochondrial membrane (IM), tafazzin (TAZ) con...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"At the inner mitochondrial membrane (IM), tafazzin (TAZ) converts monolysocardiolipin (MLCL) and phosphatidylethanolamine (PE) to cardiolipin (CL) and 1-acyl lysophosphatidylethanolamine (LPE) (Xu et al. 2003, Xu et al. 2006, Malhotra et al. 2009).  Although this reaction is reversible, the net effect of the phospholipase A and acyltransferase reactions drives it towards the formation of LPE and CL.\"}]}" ;
