ted phospholipase A2 gamma 2A (PLA2G2A) (Singer et al. 2002) or by cytosolic phospholipase A2 gamma (PLA2G4C) (Ghomashchi et al. 2010), to form 1-acyl lysophosphatidylinositol (LPI).\"}]}" ;
