ic reticulum membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LCFA(-)\", \"long-chain fatty acid anion\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1482920], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-1524021\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1524021.3\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1483142, \"displayName\": \"PC is transphosphatidylated to PG by PLD1-4/6\", \"followingEvent\": [1482920], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PC is transphosphatidylated to PG by PLD1-4/6\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1483142\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1483142.2\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1482539, \"displayName\": \"1-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by LPGAT\", \"followingEvent\": [1482920], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"1-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by LPGAT\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1482539\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1482539.2\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1482635, \"displayName\": \"2-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by LPGAT\", \"followingEvent\": [1482920], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"2-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by LPGAT\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1482635\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1482635.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1482920\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1482920.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 1482779, \"displayName\": \"At the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) membrane, phosphatidylglyc...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"At the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) membrane, phosphatidylglycerol (PG) is hydrolyzed, and has one of its acyl chains cleaved off, by cytosolic phospholipase A2 delta/zeta (PLA2G4D/F) (Ghomashchi et al. 2010) to form 2-acyl lysophosphatidylglycerol (LPG).  Cytosolic phospholipase A2 enzymes show not only PLA2 hydrolyzing activity to form the 1-acyl lysophospholipid but also have a degree of PLA1 activity, producing a 2-acyl lysophospholipid.\"}]}" ;
