L-1602420\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1602420.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 1602366, \"displayName\": \"LCFA(-) [plasma membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LCFA(-)\", \"long-chain fatty acid anion\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1602377], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-1602366\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1602366.4\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1675994, \"displayName\": \"PI3P is dephosphorylated to PI by SYNJ/MTMs at the plasma membrane\", \"followingEvent\": [1602377], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PI3P is dephosphorylated to PI by SYNJ/MTMs at the plasma membrane\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1675994\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1675994.3\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1675988, \"displayName\": \"PI4P is dephosphorylated to PI by SYNJ at the plasma membrane\", \"followingEvent\": [1602377], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PI4P is dephosphorylated to PI by SYNJ at the plasma membrane\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1675988\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1675988.2\"}], \"regulatedBy\": [{\"className\": \"NegativeRegulation\", \"dbId\": 8864273, \"displayName\": \"Negative regulation by 'PLA2R1(21-?) [extracellular region]'\", \"regulatedEntity\": [1602377], \"schemaClass\": \"NegativeRegulation\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-8864273\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-8864273.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1602377\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1602377.4\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 1602356, \"displayName\": \"At the plasma membrane, phosphatidylinositol (PI) is hydroly...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"At the plasma membrane, phosphatidylinositol (PI) is hydrolyzed, removing one of its acyl groups, to 1-acyl lysophosphatidylinositol (LPI) by secretory phospholipase A2 proteins (Singer et al. 2002, Ishizaki et al. 1999).  These include: Group IB (PLA2G1B) (Grataroli et al. 1982); Group IIA (PLA2G2A) (Seilhamer et al. 1989); Group IID (PLA2G2D) (Ishizaki et al. 1999); Group IIE (PLA2G2E) (Suzuki et al. 2000); Group IIF (PLA2G2F) (Valentin et al. 2000); Calcium-dependent Group V (PLA2G5) (Chen et al. 1994); Group X (PLA2G10) (Cupillard et al. 1997, Pan et al. 2002); and Group XIIA (PLA2G12A) (Gelb et al. 2000, Murakami et al. 2003).\"}]}" ;
