 SUMF1, inhibiting SUMF1-mediated activation of arylsulfatases\", \"inferredFrom\": [1614336], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"SUMF2 binds SUMF1, inhibiting SUMF1-mediated activation of arylsulfatases\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-1614336\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-1614336.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10386488, \"displayName\": \"SUMF2 binds SUMF1, inhibiting SUMF1-mediated activation of arylsulfatases\", \"inferredFrom\": [1614336], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"SUMF2 binds SUMF1, inhibiting SUMF1-mediated activation of arylsulfatases\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-1614336\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-1614336.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10163131, \"displayName\": \"SUMF2 binds SUMF1, inhibiting SUMF1-mediated activation of arylsulfatases\", \"inferredFrom\": [1614336], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"SUMF2 binds SUMF1, inhibiting SUMF1-mediated activation of arylsulfatases\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-1614336\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-1614336.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10040954, \"displayName\": \"SUMF2 binds SUMF1, inhibiting SUMF1-mediated activation of arylsulfatases\", \"inferredFrom\": [1614336], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"SUMF2 binds SUMF1, inhibiting SUMF1-mediated activation of arylsulfatases\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-1614336\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-1614336.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Complex\", \"dbId\": 1614330, \"displayName\": \"SUMF1:SUMF2 [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"isChimeric\": false, \"maxDepth\": 2, \"name\": [\"SUMF1:SUMF2\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1614336], \"schemaClass\": \"Complex\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1614330\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1614330.1\"}], \"previousReviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821385, \"definition\": \"structure upated after externally reviewed and then internally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"four stars\", \"name\": [\"four stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1614336\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1614336.5\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 1614343, \"displayName\": \"Sulfatase-modifying factor 2 (SUMF2, also called C-alpha-for...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Sulfatase-modifying factor 2 (SUMF2, also called C-alpha-formylglycine-generating enzyme 2, pFGE) is the paralogue of SUMF1. While SUMF1 can modify a critical residue on arylsulfatases to confer activity to them, SUMF2 lacks this ability (Mariappan et al. 2005) and instead, SUMF2 can inhibit the action of SUMF1 by dimerising with it (Zito et al. 2005, Fraldi et al. 2008, Zito et al. 2016).\"}]}" ;
