 + H(+)\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2005-06-13\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-163551\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-163551.5\"}], \"previousReviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821385, \"definition\": \"structure upated after externally reviewed and then internally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"four stars\", \"name\": [\"four stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"releaseDate\": \"2005-06-13\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-163402\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-163402.5\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 163552, \"displayName\": \"Rat HSL catalyzes the hydrolysis of diacylglycerol to yield ...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Rat HSL catalyzes the hydrolysis of diacylglycerol to yield 2-acylglycerol + fatty acid (Fredrikson and Belfrage 1983). The human event has not been studied in detail and is inferred from the rat one.\"}]}" ;
