026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Danio rerio\", \"stId\": \"R-DRE-1675824\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DRE-1675824.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10501862, \"displayName\": \"PI(4,5)P2 is dephosphorylated to PI4P by OCRL/INPP5E at the Golgi membrane\", \"inferredFrom\": [1675824], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PI(4,5)P2 is dephosphorylated to PI4P by OCRL/INPP5E at the Golgi membrane\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-1675824\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-1675824.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10387253, \"displayName\": \"PI(4,5)P2 is dephosphorylated to PI4P by OCRL/INPP5E at the Golgi membrane\", \"inferredFrom\": [1675824], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PI(4,5)P2 is dephosphorylated to PI4P by OCRL/INPP5E at the Golgi membrane\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-1675824\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-1675824.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10277083, \"displayName\": \"PI(4,5)P2 is dephosphorylated to PI4P by OCRL/INPP5E at the Golgi membrane\", \"inferredFrom\": [1675824], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PI(4,5)P2 is dephosphorylated to PI4P by OCRL/INPP5E at the Golgi membrane\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-1675824\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-1675824.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10163831, \"displayName\": \"PI(4,5)P2 is dephosphorylated to PI4P by OCRL/INPP5E at the Golgi membrane\", \"inferredFrom\": [1675824], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PI(4,5)P2 is dephosphorylated to PI4P by OCRL/INPP5E at the Golgi membrane\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-1675824\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-1675824.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 1806217, \"displayName\": \"PI4P [Golgi membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PI4P\", \"1-phosphatidyl-1D-myo-inositol 4-phosphate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1675824], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-1806217\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1806217.3\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29372, \"displayName\": \"Pi [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Pi\", \"hydrogenphosphate\", \"Orthophosphate\", \"Phosphate\", \"Inorganic Phosphate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1675824], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29372\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29372.5\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1675824\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1675824.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 1675951, \"displayName\": \"At the Golgi membrane, phosphatidylinositol 4-phosphate (PI4...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"At the Golgi membrane, phosphatidylinositol 4-phosphate (PI4P) inositol polyphosphate 5-phosphatase OCRL-1 (OCRL) (Choudhury et al. 2009, Suchy et al. 1995, Zhang et al. 1995) and 72 kDa inositol polyphosphate 5-phosphatase (INPP5E) (Bilas et al. 2009) dephosphorylate phosphatidylinositol 4,5-bisphosphate (PI(4,5)P2) to form phosphatidylinositol 4-phosphate (PI4P).  INPP5E is located in the Golgi membrane, mediated by its N-terminal proline-rich domain (Kong et al. 2000).\"}]}" ;
