\"displayName\": \"PI3P is dephosphorylated to PI by SACM1L at the Golgi membrane\", \"followingEvent\": [1675961], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PI3P is dephosphorylated to PI by SACM1L at the Golgi membrane\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1676114\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1676114.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1675961\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1675961.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 1675770, \"displayName\": \"At the Golgi membrane, phosphatidylinositol 3-kinase catalyt...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"At the Golgi membrane, phosphatidylinositol 3-kinase catalytic subunit type 3 (PIK3C3) aka VPS34 is bound to phosphoinositide 3-kinase regulatory subunit 4 (PIK3R4).  This PIK3C3:PIK2R4 complex and phosphatidylinositol-4-phosphate 3-kinase C2 domain-containing subunit alpha (PIK3C2A) phosphorylate phosphatidylinositol (PI) to phosphatidylinositol 3-phosphate (PI3P).<br><br>The following lists the above proteins with their corresponding literature references: PIK3C3:PIK2R4 (Panaretou et al. 1997, Volinia et al. 1995) and PIK3C2A (Arcaro et al. 2000, Domin et al. 2000).\"}]}" ;
