"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1676152\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1676152.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 1675818, \"displayName\": \"At the Golgi membrane, ADP-ribosylation factor 1 and 3 (ARF1...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"At the Golgi membrane, ADP-ribosylation factor 1 and 3 (ARF1 and ARF3) complexed to GTP bind to phosphatidylinositol 4-kinase beta (PI4KB) and activate it (Haynes et al. 2007, Wong et al. 1997, Godi et al. 1999).\"}]}" ;
