P by TPTE2 at the Golgi membrane\", \"inferredFrom\": [1676204], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PI(3,4)P2 is dephosphorylated to PI4P by TPTE2 at the Golgi membrane\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-1676204\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-1676204.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 1806217, \"displayName\": \"PI4P [Golgi membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PI4P\", \"1-phosphatidyl-1D-myo-inositol 4-phosphate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1676204], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-1806217\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1806217.3\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29372, \"displayName\": \"Pi [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Pi\", \"hydrogenphosphate\", \"Orthophosphate\", \"Phosphate\", \"Inorganic Phosphate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [1676204], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29372\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29372.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 1675928, \"displayName\": \"PI4P is phosphorylated to PI(3,4)P2 by PIK3C2A/G at the Golgi membrane\", \"followingEvent\": [1676204], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PI4P is phosphorylated to PI(3,4)P2 by PIK3C2A/G at the Golgi membrane\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1675928\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1675928.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\