leaseDate\": \"2016-06-15\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-8848215\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-8848215.5\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2007-02-20\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-191323\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-191323.5\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 191353, \"displayName\": \"The cytosolic form of 3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl Coenzyme A ...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"The cytosolic form of 3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl Coenzyme A synthase (HMGCS1) catalyzes the condensation of acetyl CoA with acetoacetyl CoA to produce HMG-CoA. HMGCS1 is ubiquitously expressed in the body and is involved in synthesis of isoprenoids and cholesterol biosynthesis (Rokosz et al. 1994).\"}]}" ;
