 MVA\", \"(3S)-3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl-CoA + 2 NADPH + 2 H(+) => (R)-mevalonate + 2 NADP(+) + CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-191352\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-191352.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10127713, \"displayName\": \"HMGCR dimer reduces bHMG-CoA to MVA\", \"inferredFrom\": [191352], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HMGCR dimer reduces bHMG-CoA to MVA\", \"(3S)-3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl-CoA + 2 NADPH + 2 H(+) => (R)-mevalonate + 2 NADP(+) + CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-191352\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-191352.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10006813, \"displayName\": \"HMGCR dimer reduces bHMG-CoA to MVA\", \"inferredFrom\": [191352], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HMGCR dimer reduces bHMG-CoA to MVA\", \"(3S)-3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl-CoA + 2 NADPH + 2 H(+) => (R)-mevalonate + 2 NADP(+) + CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-191352\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-191352.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 191424, \"displayName\": \"MVA [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"MVA\", \"(R)-mevalonate\", \"Mevalonate\", \"(R)-mevalonic acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [191352], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-191424\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-191424.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 76194, \"displayName\": \"CoA-SH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CoA-SH\", \"coenzyme A(4-)\", \"coenzyme A\"], \"producedByEvent\": [191352], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-76194\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-76194.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29366, \"displayName\": \"NADP+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADP+\", \"NADP(3-)\", \"NADP\", \"NADP(+)\", \"Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"beta-Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"TPN\", \"Triphosphopyridine nucleotide\"], \"producedByEvent\": [191352, 191352], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29366\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29366.5\"}, 29366], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 191323, \"displayName\": \"HMGCS1 condenses Ac-CoA and ACA-CoA to form bHMG-CoA\", \"followingEvent\": [191352], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HMGCS1 condenses Ac-CoA and ACA-CoA to form bHMG-CoA\", \"acetoacetyl-CoA + acetyl-CoA + H2O => (3S)-3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl-CoA + CoA + H(+)\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2007-02-20\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-191323\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-191323.5\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2007-02-20\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-191352\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-191352.5\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 191349, \"displayName\": \"Dimeric 3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl-CoA reductase (HMGCR dime...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Dimeric 3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl-CoA reductase (HMGCR dimer) (Istvan et al. 2000) catalyzes the four-electron reduction of beta-hydroxy-beta-methylglutaryl-CoA (bHMG-CoA) to mevalonate (MVA). MVA concentrations in the cell are tightly controlled through regulation of the activity of HMGCR dimer, which is one of the most highly regulated enzymes in metabolism (Goldstein & Brown 1990).\"}]}" ;
