lycocholate or taurocholate\", \"choloyl-CoA + glycine => CoA + glycocholate + H(+)\", \"choloyl-CoA + taurine => CoA + H(+) + taurocholate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Caenorhabditis elegans\", \"stId\": \"R-CEL-192312\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CEL-192312.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10753344, \"displayName\": \"Choloyl CoA reacts with glycine or taurine to form glycocholate or taurocholate\", \"inferredFrom\": [192312], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Choloyl CoA reacts with glycine or taurine to form glycocholate or taurocholate\", \"choloyl-CoA + glycine => CoA + glycocholate + H(+)\", \"choloyl-CoA + taurine => CoA + H(+) + taurocholate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Gallus gallus\", \"stId\": \"R-GGA-192312\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-GGA-192312.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10671042, \"displayName\": \"Choloyl CoA reacts with glycine or taurine to form glycocholate or taurocholate\", \"inferredFrom\": [192312], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Choloyl CoA reacts with glycine or taurine to form glycocholate or taurocholate\", \"choloyl-CoA + glycine => CoA + glycocholate + H(+)\", \"choloyl-CoA + taurine => CoA + H(+) + taurocholate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"stId\": \"R-XTR-192312\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-XTR-192312.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10470453, \"displayName\": \"Choloyl CoA reacts with glycine or taurine to form glycocholate or taurocholate\", \"inferredFrom\": [192312], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Choloyl CoA reacts with glycine or taurine to form glycocholate or taurocholate\", \"choloyl-CoA + glycine => CoA + glycocholate + H(+)\", \"choloyl-CoA + taurine => CoA + H(+) + taurocholate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-192312\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-192312.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10248512, \"displayName\": \"Choloyl CoA reacts with glycine or taurine to form glycocholate or taurocholate\", \"inferredFrom\": [192312], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Choloyl CoA reacts with glycine or taurine to form glycocholate or taurocholate\", \"choloyl-CoA + glycine => CoA + glycocholate + H(+)\", \"choloyl-CoA + taurine => CoA + H(+) + taurocholate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-192312\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-192312.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10128117, \"displayName\": \"Choloyl CoA reacts with glycine or taurine to form glycocholate or taurocholate\", \"inferredFrom\": [192312], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Choloyl CoA reacts with glycine or taurine to form glycocholate or taurocholate\", \"choloyl-CoA + glycine => CoA + glycocholate + H(+)\", \"choloyl-CoA + taurine => CoA + H(+) + taurocholate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-192312\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-192312.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10007183, \"displayName\": \"Choloyl CoA reacts with glycine or taurine to form glycocholate or taurocholate\", \"inferredFrom\": [192312], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Choloyl CoA reacts with glycine or taurine to form glycocholate or taurocholate\", \"choloyl-CoA + glycine => CoA + glycocholate + H(+)\", \"choloyl-CoA + taurine => CoA + H(+) + taurocholate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-192312\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-192312.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Set\", \"dbId\": 193404, \"displayName\": \"cholate bile salts [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 2, \"name\": [\"cholate bile salts\", \"glycocholate; taurocholate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [192312], \"schemaClass\": \"DefinedSet\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-193404\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-193404.1\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 193514, \"displayName\": \"CoA-SH [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CoA-SH\", \"coenzyme A(4-)\", \"coenzyme A\"], \"producedByEvent\": [192312], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-193514\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-193514.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 193465, \"displayName\": \"H+ [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\"], \"producedByEvent\": [192312], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-193465\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-193465.3\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 192341, \"displayName\": \"Thiolysis of 3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholan-24-one-CoA yields choloyl-CoA (3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholan-24-one-CoA) and propionyl CoA\", \"followingEvent\": [192312], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Thiolysis of 3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholan-24-one-CoA yields choloyl-CoA (3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholan-24-one-CoA) and propionyl CoA\", \"3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-24-oxo-5beta-cholestan-26-oyl-CoA + CoA => choloyl-CoA + propanoyl-CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2007-05-15\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-192341\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-192341.3\"}], \"previousReviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821384, \"definition\": \"structure updated after externally and internally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"two stars\", \"name\": [\"two stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"releaseDate\": \"2007-05-15\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821385, \"definition\": \"structure upated after externally reviewed and then internally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"four stars\", \"name\": [\"four stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-192312\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-192312.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 192354, \"displayName\": \"Choloyl CoA reacts with glycine or taurine to form glycochol...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Choloyl CoA reacts with glycine or taurine to form glycocholate or taurocholate, releasing CoASH. This reaction, which completes the de novo synthesis of bile salts from cholesterol in vivo, is catalyzed by BAAT (Bile acid CoA:amino acid N-acyltransferase - Falany et al. 1994) and occurs in the peroxisomal matrix (Solaas et al. 2000; Mihalik et al. 2002). In vivo, the relative amounts of glycocholate and taurocholate synthesized appear to be determined solely by the intracellular abundances of glycine and taurine (Russell 2003).\"}]}" ;
