sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-192331\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-192331.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 192313, \"displayName\": \"3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholest-24-enoyl-CoA ...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholest-24-enoyl-CoA (THCA-CoA) is hydrated to form (24R, 25R) 3alpha,7alpha,12alpha,24-tetrahydroxy-5beta-cholestanoyl-CoA. This reaction, catalyzed by the peroxisomal D-bifunctional enzyme (Huyghe et al. 2006), occurs in the peroxisomal matrix.\"}]}" ;
