Molecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-192356\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-192356.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 192314, \"displayName\": \"propionyl CoA [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"propionyl CoA\", \"propionyl-CoA(4-)\", \"propionyl-CoA\"], \"producedByEvent\": [192341], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-192314\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-192314.4\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 193455, \"displayName\": \"(24R, 25R) 3alpha,7alpha,12alpha,24-tetrahydroxy-5beta-cholestanoyl-CoA is oxidized to 3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholest-24-one-CoA\", \"followingEvent\": [192341], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"(24R, 25R) 3alpha,7alpha,12alpha,24-tetrahydroxy-5beta-cholestanoyl-CoA is oxidized to 3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholest-24-one-CoA\", \"(24R,25R)-3alpha,7alpha,12alpha,24-tetrahydroxy-5beta-cholestan-26-oyl-CoA + NAD(+) = 3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-24-oxo-5beta-cholestan-26-oyl-CoA + H(+) + NADH\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2007-05-15\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-193455\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-193455.3\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2007-05-15\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-192341\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-192341.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 192301, \"displayName\": \"3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholan-24-one-CoA and...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholan-24-one-CoA and CoASH react to form choloyl-CoA (3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholan-24-one-CoA) and propionyl CoA. This reaction, in the peroxisomal matrix, is catalyzed by peroxisomal thiolase 2 (sterol carrier protein 2).\"}]}" ;
