HSD3B2 dimer isomerise DHA to ANDST\", \"inferredFrom\": [193073], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HSD2B1 dimer, HSD3B2 dimer isomerise DHA to ANDST\", \"DHA isomerizes to 4-Androstene3,17-dione\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Danio rerio\", \"stId\": \"R-DRE-193073\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DRE-193073.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10470607, \"displayName\": \"HSD2B1 dimer, HSD3B2 dimer isomerise DHA to ANDST\", \"inferredFrom\": [193073], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HSD2B1 dimer, HSD3B2 dimer isomerise DHA to ANDST\", \"DHA isomerizes to 4-Androstene3,17-dione\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-193073\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-193073.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10355773, \"displayName\": \"HSD2B1 dimer, HSD3B2 dimer isomerise DHA to ANDST\", \"inferredFrom\": [193073], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HSD2B1 dimer, HSD3B2 dimer isomerise DHA to ANDST\", \"DHA isomerizes to 4-Androstene3,17-dione\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-193073\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-193073.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10248613, \"displayName\": \"HSD2B1 dimer, HSD3B2 dimer isomerise DHA to ANDST\", \"inferredFrom\": [193073], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HSD2B1 dimer, HSD3B2 dimer isomerise DHA to ANDST\", \"DHA isomerizes to 4-Androstene3,17-dione\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-193073\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-193073.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10128340, \"displayName\": \"HSD2B1 dimer, HSD3B2 dimer isomerise DHA to ANDST\", \"inferredFrom\": [193073], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HSD2B1 dimer, HSD3B2 dimer isomerise DHA to ANDST\", \"DHA isomerizes to 4-Androstene3,17-dione\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-193073\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-193073.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10007377, \"displayName\": \"HSD2B1 dimer, HSD3B2 dimer isomerise DHA to ANDST\", \"inferredFrom\": [193073], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HSD2B1 dimer, HSD3B2 dimer isomerise DHA to ANDST\", \"DHA isomerizes to 4-Androstene3,17-dione\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-193073\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-193073.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 193079, \"displayName\": \"ANDST [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ANDST\", \"androst-4-ene-3,17-dione\", \"4-Androstene-3, 17-dione\"], \"producedByEvent\": [193073], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-193079\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-193079.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 73473, \"displayName\": \"NADH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADH\", \"NADH(2-)\"], \"producedByEvent\": [193073], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-73473\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-73473.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 70106, \"displayName\": \"H+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\", \"proton\"], \"producedByEvent\": [193073], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-70106\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-70106.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 193070, \"displayName\": \"CYP17A1 cleaves 17aHPREG to DHA\", \"followingEvent\": [193073], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CYP17A1 cleaves 17aHPREG to DHA\", \"Side chain cleavage of 17alpha-hydroxypregnenolone to yield DHA\", \"17alpha-hydroxyprenenolone + NADPH + H+ + O2 => DHA (dehydroepiandrostenedione) + NADP+ + H2O + acetaldehyde\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2007-05-15\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-193070\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-193070.4\"}], \"regulatedBy\": [{\"className\": \"PositiveRegulation\", \"dbId\": 1449719, \"displayName\": \"Positive regulation by 'POMC(138-176) [cytosol]'\", \"regulatedEntity\": [193073], \"schemaClass\": \"PositiveRegulation\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1449719\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1449719.1\"}], \"regulationReference\": [{\"className\": \"RegulationReference\", \"dbId\": 9642807, \"displayName\": \"Positive regulation by 'POMC(138-176) [cytosol]' A critical review of the origin and control of adrenal androgens\", \"schemaClass\": \"RegulationReference\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2007-05-15\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-193073\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-193073.5\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 193085, \"displayName\": \"In this two-step reaction catalyzed by 3beta-HSD associated ...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"In this two-step reaction catalyzed by 3beta-HSD associated with the endoplasmic reticulum membrane, the 3-hydroxyl group of DHA is oxidized to a keto group and the double bond in the steroid nucleus is then isomerized from the five to the 4 position. Corticotropin (Adrenocorticotropic hormone, ACTH) acts through the ACTH receptor called melanocortin receptor type 2 (MC2R) to stimulate steroidogenesis, increasing the production of androgens (McKenna et al, 1997).\"}]}" ;
