e (17aHPROG), NADPH + H+, and O2 r...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"17Alpha-hydroxyprogesterone (17aHPROG), NADPH + H+, and O2 react to form 4-Androstene-3, 17-dione (ANDST), NADP+, H2O, and acetaldehyde. Steroid 17 alpha hydroxylase/17,20 lyase (CYP17A1), which also catalyzes 17-alpha-hydroxylation, catalyzes this lyase reaction.\"}]}" ;
