aproaldehyde\", \"20alpha,22beta-hydroxycholesterol + NADPH + H+ + O2 => pregnenolone + isocaproaldehyde + NADP+ + H2O\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-193101\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-193101.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 193164, \"displayName\": \"PREG [mitochondrial matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PREG\", \"pregnenolone\"], \"producedByEvent\": [193101], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-193164\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-193164.3\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 193046, \"displayName\": \"ISCAL [mitochondrial matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ISCAL\", \"4-methylpentanal\", \"Isocaproic aldehyde\", \"isocaproaldehyde\"], \"producedByEvent\": [193101], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-193046\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-193046.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 113521, \"displayName\": \"H2O [mitochondrial matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H2O\", \"water\"], \"producedByEvent\": [193101, 193101], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-113521\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-113521.3\"}, 113521, {\"className\": \"Complex\", \"dbId\": 5580259, \"displayName\": \"CYP11A1:FDXR:FDX1,FDX1L (ox.) [mitochondrial matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"isChimeric\": false, \"maxDepth\": 4, \"name\": [\"CYP11A1:FDXR:FDX1,FDX1L (ox.)\"], \"producedByEvent\": [193101, 193101], \"schemaClass\": \"Complex\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-5580259\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-5580259.1\"}, 5580259, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 113563, \"displayName\": \"NADP+ [mitochondrial matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADP+\", \"NADP(3-)\", \"NADP\", \"NADP(+)\", \"Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"beta-Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"TPN\", \"Triphosphopyridine nucleotide\"], \"producedByEvent\": [193101, 193101], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-113563\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-113563.6\"}, 113563], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 193065, \"displayName\": \"Oxidation of 22beta-hydroxycholesterol to 20alpha,22beta-hydroxycholesterol\", \"followingEvent\": [193101], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Oxidation of 22beta-hydroxycholesterol to 20alpha,22beta-hydroxycholesterol\", \"22beta-hydroxycholesterol + NADPH + H+ + O2 => 20alpha,22beta-hydroxycholesterol + NADP+ + H2O\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2007-05-15\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-193065\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-193065.2\"}], \"previousReviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821385, \"definition\": \"structure upated after externally reviewed and then internally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"four stars\", \"name\": [\"four stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"releaseDate\": \"2007-05-15\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-193101\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-193101.5\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 193127, \"displayName\": \"20alpha,22beta-hydroxycholesterol (20a,22b-DHCHOL), NADPH + ...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"20alpha,22beta-hydroxycholesterol (20a,22b-DHCHOL), NADPH + H+, and O2 react to form pregnenolone (PREG), isocaproaldehyde (ISCAL), NADP+ and H2O. This cleavage reaction is catalysed by CYP11A (P450scc) associated with the inner mitochondrial membrane (Strushkevich et al. 2011). PREG is substantially more hydrophilic than cholesterol (CHOL) and hydroxycholesterol (HCHOL) and is released into the mitochondrial matrix.\"}]}" ;
