-enoyl-CoA + H2O2\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-193369\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-193369.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 193459, \"displayName\": \"25(S) 3alpha,7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholest-24-enoyl-CoA [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"25(S) 3alpha,7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholest-24-enoyl-CoA\", \"3alpha,7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholest-24-enoyl-CoA\"], \"producedByEvent\": [193369], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-193459\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-193459.3\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 113575, \"displayName\": \"H2O2 [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H2O2\", \"hydrogen peroxide\"], \"producedByEvent\": [193369], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-113575\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-113575.3\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 193452, \"displayName\": \"Isomerization of 25(R) DHCA-CoA to 25(S) DHCA-CoA\", \"followingEvent\": [193369], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Isomerization of 25(R) DHCA-CoA to 25(S) DHCA-CoA\", \"25(R) DHCA-CoA => 25(S) DHCA-CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2007-05-15\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-193452\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-193452.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2007-05-15\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-193369\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-193369.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 193468, \"displayName\": \"25(S) DHCA-CoA and O2 react to form 25(S) 3alpha,7alpha-dihy...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"25(S) DHCA-CoA and O2 react to form 25(S) 3alpha,7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholest-24-enoyl-CoA and H2O2. This dehydrogenation reaction occurs in the peroxisomal matrix. It is catalyzed by the FAD-containing peroxisomal enzyme branched chain acyl-CoA oxidase (ACOX2). The enzyme transfers electrons to molecular oxygen and hydrogen peroxide is produced as a byproduct.\"}]}" ;
