olesten-7alpha,27-diol-3-one\", \"inferredFrom\": [193816], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Cholest-5-ene-3beta,7alpha,27-triol is oxidized and isomerized to 4-cholesten-7alpha,27-diol-3-one\", \"Cholest-5-ene-3beta,7alpha,27-triol + NAD+ => 4-cholesten-7alpha,27-diol-3-one +NADH + H+\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-193816\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-193816.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10007649, \"displayName\": \"Cholest-5-ene-3beta,7alpha,27-triol is oxidized and isomerized to 4-cholesten-7alpha,27-diol-3-one\", \"inferredFrom\": [193816], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Cholest-5-ene-3beta,7alpha,27-triol is oxidized and isomerized to 4-cholesten-7alpha,27-diol-3-one\", \"Cholest-5-ene-3beta,7alpha,27-triol + NAD+ => 4-cholesten-7alpha,27-diol-3-one +NADH + H+\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-193816\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-193816.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 193835, \"displayName\": \"4CHOL7a,27DONE [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"4CHOL7a,27DONE\", \"7alpha,26-dihydroxycholest-4-en-3-one\", \"4-cholesten-7alpha,27-diol-3-one\"], \"producedByEvent\": [193816], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-193835\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-193835.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 73473, \"displayName\": \"NADH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADH\", \"NADH(2-)\"], \"producedByEvent\": [193816], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-73473\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-73473.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 70106, \"displayName\": \"H+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\", \"proton\"], \"producedByEvent\": [193816], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-70106\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-70106.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 191972, \"displayName\": \"27-hydroxycholesterol is 7alpha-hydroxylated\", \"followingEvent\": [193816], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"27-hydroxycholesterol is 7alpha-hydroxylated\", \"27-hydroxycholesterol + NADPH + H+ + O2 => cholest-5-ene-3beta,7alpha,27-triol + H2O + NADP+\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2007-05-15\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-191972\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-191972.3\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2007-05-15\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-193816\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-193816.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 193797, \"displayName\": \"Cholest-5-ene-3beta,7alpha,27-triol and NAD+ react to form 4...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Cholest-5-ene-3beta,7alpha,27-triol and NAD+ react to form 4-cholesten-7alpha,27-diol-3-one and NADH + H+, in a reaction catalyzed by HSD3B7 (3 beta-hydroxysteroid dehydrogenase type 7) in the endoplasmic reticulum membrane. Its function in vivo has been confirmed in studies of patients with defects in bile acid synthesis (Schwarz et al. 2000).\"}]}" ;
