dises 11DCORST to CORST\", \"inferredFrom\": [194017], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CYP11B2 oxidises 11DCORST to CORST\", \"21-hydroxyprogesterone + 2 H(+) + O2 + 2 reduced (adrenodoxin) => corticosterone + H2O + 2 oxidized (adrenodoxin)\", \"11-deoxycorticosterone + NADPH + H+ + O2 => corticosterone + H2O + NADP+\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-194017\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-194017.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 194005, \"displayName\": \"CORST [mitochondrial matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CORST\", \"corticosterone\"], \"producedByEvent\": [194017], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-194005\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-194005.3\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 113521, \"displayName\": \"H2O [mitochondrial matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H2O\", \"water\"], \"producedByEvent\": [194017], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-113521\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-113521.3\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 113563, \"displayName\": \"NADP+ [mitochondrial matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADP+\", \"NADP(3-)\", \"NADP\", \"NADP(+)\", \"Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"beta-Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"TPN\", \"Triphosphopyridine nucleotide\"], \"producedByEvent\": [194017, 194017], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-113563\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-113563.6\"}, 113563], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"omitted\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 193996, \"displayName\": \"11DCORST translocates from cytosol to mitochondrial matrix\", \"followingEvent\": [194017], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"11DCORST translocates from cytosol to mitochondrial matrix\", \"11-deoxycorticosterone translocates from the cytosol to the mitochondrial matrix\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2007-05-15\", \"schemaClass\": \"BlackBoxEvent\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-193996\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-193996.3\"}], \"previousReviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821385, \"definition\": \"structure upated after externally reviewed and then internally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"four stars\", \"name\": [\"four stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"releaseDate\": \"2007-05-15\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-194017\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-194017.4\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 196358, \"displayName\": \"Cytochrome P450 11B2, mitochondrial (CYP11B2 aka aldosterone...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Cytochrome P450 11B2, mitochondrial (CYP11B2 aka aldosterone hydroxylase) is an enzyme necessary for aldosterone biosynthesis via corticosterone (CORST) and 18-hydroxycorticosterone (18HCORST). The 11-beta oxidation of 11-deoxycorticosterone (11DCORST) leads to corticosterone (CORST) and 18-hydroxylation of this leads to 18-hydroxycorticosterone (18HCORST). 18-oxidation of 18HCORST yields aldosterone. \"}]}" ;
