from cytosol to extracellular region\", \"Efflux of bile salts from enterocytes to portal system by MRP3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-194153\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-194153.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10356159, \"displayName\": \"ABCC3 transports bile salts from cytosol to extracellular region\", \"inferredFrom\": [194153], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ABCC3 transports bile salts from cytosol to extracellular region\", \"Efflux of bile salts from enterocytes to portal system by MRP3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-194153\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-194153.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10248973, \"displayName\": \"ABCC3 transports bile salts from cytosol to extracellular region\", \"inferredFrom\": [194153], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ABCC3 transports bile salts from cytosol to extracellular region\", \"Efflux of bile salts from enterocytes to portal system by MRP3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-194153\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-194153.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10128756, \"displayName\": \"ABCC3 transports bile salts from cytosol to extracellular region\", \"inferredFrom\": [194153], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ABCC3 transports bile salts from cytosol to extracellular region\", \"Efflux of bile salts from enterocytes to portal system by MRP3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-194153\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-194153.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10007739, \"displayName\": \"ABCC3 transports bile salts from cytosol to extracellular region\", \"inferredFrom\": [194153], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ABCC3 transports bile salts from cytosol to extracellular region\", \"Efflux of bile salts from enterocytes to portal system by MRP3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-194153\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-194153.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29370, \"displayName\": \"ADP [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ADP\", \"ADP(3-)\", \"Adenosine 5'-diphosphate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [194153], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29370\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29370.6\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29372, \"displayName\": \"Pi [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Pi\", \"hydrogenphosphate\", \"Orthophosphate\", \"Phosphate\", \"Inorganic Phosphate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [194153], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29372\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29372.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Set\", \"dbId\": 192483, \"displayName\": \"bile salts and acids [extracellular region]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 2, \"name\": [\"bile salts and acids\"], \"producedByEvent\": [194153], \"schemaClass\": \"DefinedSet\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-192483\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-192483.1\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"omitted\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 9733969, \"displayName\": \"Bile salts dissociate from FABP6\", \"followingEvent\": [194153], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Bile salts dissociate from FABP6\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2021-09-15\", \"schemaClass\": \"BlackBoxEvent\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9733969\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9733969.3\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2007-05-15\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-194153\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-194153.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 194188, \"displayName\": \"A molecule of glycocholate, taurocholate, or taurochenodeoxy...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"A molecule of glycocholate, taurocholate, or taurochenodeoxycholate is transported from the cytosol to the extracellular space, coupled to the hydrolysis of a molecule of cytosolic ATP to ADP and orthophosphate. This reaction is mediated by ABCC3 (MRP3). In the body, this reaction mediates the release of bile salts from enterocytes into the blood (Kullak-Ublick et al. 2004; Trauner and Boyer 2002). In the cytosol, bile salts and acids are bound to a carrier protein, FABP6 (I-BABP) (Fujita et al. 1995), and in the blood these molecules are complexed with albumin. The mechanisms by which transport across the plasma membrane is coupled to release from FABP6 and binding to albumin are unknown, so the entire process is annotated as a single concerted event.\"}]}" ;
