O-hexadecanoyl-(R)-carnitine\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-200406\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-200406.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10357873, \"displayName\": \"CPT1A transfers PALM to CAR\", \"inferredFrom\": [200406], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CPT1A transfers PALM to CAR\", \"palmitoyl-CoA + carnitine => palmitoylcarnitine + CoASH\", \"(R)-carnitine + hexadecanoyl-CoA => CoA + O-hexadecanoyl-(R)-carnitine\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-200406\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-200406.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10250469, \"displayName\": \"CPT1A transfers PALM to CAR\", \"inferredFrom\": [200406], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CPT1A transfers PALM to CAR\", \"palmitoyl-CoA + carnitine => palmitoylcarnitine + CoASH\", \"(R)-carnitine + hexadecanoyl-CoA => CoA + O-hexadecanoyl-(R)-carnitine\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-200406\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-200406.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10130455, \"displayName\": \"CPT1A transfers PALM to CAR\", \"inferredFrom\": [200406], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CPT1A transfers PALM to CAR\", \"palmitoyl-CoA + carnitine => palmitoylcarnitine + CoASH\", \"(R)-carnitine + hexadecanoyl-CoA => CoA + O-hexadecanoyl-(R)-carnitine\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-200406\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-200406.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10009177, \"displayName\": \"CPT1A transfers PALM to CAR\", \"inferredFrom\": [200406], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CPT1A transfers PALM to CAR\", \"palmitoyl-CoA + carnitine => palmitoylcarnitine + CoASH\", \"(R)-carnitine + hexadecanoyl-CoA => CoA + O-hexadecanoyl-(R)-carnitine\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-200406\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-200406.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 76194, \"displayName\": \"CoA-SH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CoA-SH\", \"coenzyme A(4-)\", \"coenzyme A\"], \"producedByEvent\": [200406], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-76194\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-76194.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 201034, \"displayName\": \"L-PCAR [mitochondrial intermembrane space]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"L-PCAR\", \"O-palmitoyl-L-carnitine\", \"L-Palmitoylcarnitine\", \"C16-CAR\"], \"producedByEvent\": [200406], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-201034\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-201034.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"omitted\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 8949399, \"displayName\": \"CAR translocates from the cytosol to the mitochondrial intermembrane space\", \"followingEvent\": [200406], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CAR translocates from the cytosol to the mitochondrial intermembrane space\", \"(R)-carnitine(in) = (R)-carnitine(out)\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2017-03-27\", \"schemaClass\": \"BlackBoxEvent\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-8949399\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-8949399.3\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 434382, \"displayName\": \"ACSL3,4 ligates coenzyme A (CoA-SH) to a long chain fatty acid yielding fatty acyl-coenzyme A\", \"followingEvent\": [200406], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ACSL3,4 ligates coenzyme A (CoA-SH) to a long chain fatty acid yielding fatty acyl-coenzyme A\", \"a long-chain fatty acid + ATP + CoA => a long-chain fatty acyl-CoA + AMP + diphosphate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2019-03-20\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-434382\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-434382.4\"}, {\"category\": \"dissociation\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 5634100, \"displayName\": \"FABP5 dissociates from RXRA:PPARD:atRA\", \"followingEvent\": [200406], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"FABP5 dissociates from RXRA:PPARD:atRA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2014-12-11\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-5634100\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-5634100.2\"}], \"regulatedBy\": [{\"className\": \"NegativeRegulation\", \"dbId\": 200418, \"displayName\": \"Negative regulation by 'Mal-CoA [cytosol]'\", \"regulatedEntity\": [200406], \"schemaClass\": \"NegativeRegulation\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-200418\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-200418.3\"}, {\"className\": \"PositiveRegulation\", \"dbId\": 5422944, \"displayName\": \"Positive regulation by 'RXRA:PPARD:atRA [nucleoplasm]'\", \"regulatedEntity\": [200406], \"schemaClass\": \"PositiveRegulation\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-5422944\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-5422944.2\"}], \"regulationReference\": [{\"className\": \"RegulationReference\", \"dbId\": 9642880, \"displayName\": \"Negative regulation by 'Mal-CoA [cytosol]' Structural model of a malonyl-CoA-binding site of carnitine octanoyltransferase and carnitine palmitoyltransferase I: mutational analysis of a malonyl-CoA affinity domain\", \"schemaClass\": \"RegulationReference\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2005-09-26\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-200406\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-200406.9\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 201082, \"displayName\": \"Carnitine palmitoyl transferase 1A (CPT1A) associated with t...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Carnitine palmitoyl transferase 1A (CPT1A) associated with the inner mitochondrial membrane, catalyzes the reaction of palmitoyl-CoA (PALM-CoA) from the cytosol with carnitine (CAR) in the mitochondrial intermembrane space to form palmitoylcarnitine (L-PCARN) and CoA-SH. Three CPT1 isoforms exist; CPT1A, B and C. In the body, CPT1A is most abundant in liver while CPT1B is abundant in muscle. CPT1C is mainly expressed in neurons and localises to the ER and not to the mitochondria. It has little or no enzymatic activity in fatty acid oxidation. Both CPT1A and CPT1B are inhibited by malonyl-CoA (Morillas et al. 2002, 2004; Zammit et al. 2001; Zhu et al. 1997). Mutations in CPT1A are associated with defects in fatty acid metabolism and fasting intolerance, consistent with the role assigned to CPT1 from studies in vitro and in animal models (IJlst et al. 1998; Gobin et al. 2003).<br>In the nucleus, cellular retinoic acid-binding protein 1 or 2 (CRABP1 or 2), bound to all-trans-retinoic acid (atRA), directly binds to the heterodimeric complex of retinoic acid receptor alpha RXRA) and peroxisome proliferator-activated receptor delta (PPARD). When bound to PPARD, atRA can significantly increase the expression of proteins involved in fatty acid oxidation such as CPT1A via its induction of PPARD (Amengual et al. 2012).\"}]}" ;
