ticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"DTA-CoA\", \"(7Z,10Z,13Z,16Z)-docosatetraenoyl-CoA\", \"7Z,10Z,13Z,16Z-docosatetraenoyl-CoA (DTA-CoA)\", \"3-oxo-(7,10,13,16)-docosatetraenoyl-CoA\", \"Adrenic acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2046083], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-2046060\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-2046060.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 159751, \"displayName\": \"CO2 [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CO2\", \"carbon dioxide\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2046083], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-159751\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-159751.3\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 162743, \"displayName\": \"CoA-SH [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CoA-SH\", \"coenzyme A(4-)\", \"coenzyme A\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2046083], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-162743\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-162743.6\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 113519, \"displayName\": \"H2O [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H2O\", \"water\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2046083], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-113519\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-113519.3\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 2046092, \"displayName\": \"Desaturation of dihomo-gamma-lenolenoyl-CoA to arachidonoyl-CoA\", \"followingEvent\": [2046083], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Desaturation of dihomo-gamma-lenolenoyl-CoA to arachidonoyl-CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2046092\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2046092.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2046083\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2046083.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 2045934, \"displayName\": \"Arachidonyl-CoA undergoes a two-carbon chain elongation on t...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Arachidonyl-CoA undergoes a two-carbon chain elongation on the carboxyl end to form docosatetraenoyl-CoA (DTA-CoA/Adrenic acid/7,10,13,16-docosatetraenoic acid (7,10,13,16-22:4(n-6)). This reaction is catalyzed by the enzymes ELOVL5 or ELOVL2.  Malanoyl-CoA provides the additional two carbons required for elongation. Docosatetraenoyl-CoA is further metabolized by cyclooxygenases (COX), lipoxygenases (LO) and cytochrome P450s (CYP450s) to dihomo (DH) eicosanoids (Kopf et al. 2010, Leonard et al. 2004).\"}]}" ;
