osapentaenoyl-CoA\", \"5Z,8Z,11Z,14Z,17Z-eicosapentaenoyl-CoA\", \"5,8,11,14,17-20:5(n-3)\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2046089], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-2046059\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-2046059.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 113519, \"displayName\": \"H2O [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H2O\", \"water\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2046089, 2046089], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-113519\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-113519.3\"}, 113519, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 194653, \"displayName\": \"NAD+ [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NAD+\", \"NAD(1-)\", \"NAD\", \"NAD(+)\", \"Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide\", \"DPN\", \"Diphosphopyridine nucleotide\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2046089, 2046089], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-194653\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-194653.5\"}, 194653], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 2046088, \"displayName\": \"Elongation of stearidonoyl-CoA to eicosatetraenoyl-CoA\", \"followingEvent\": [2046089], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Elongation of stearidonoyl-CoA to eicosatetraenoyl-CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2046088\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2046088.3\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-06-12\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2046089\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2046089.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 2045928, \"displayName\": \"Eicosatetraenoyl-CoA (ETA-CoA) is desaturated by an addition...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Eicosatetraenoyl-CoA (ETA-CoA) is desaturated by an additional carbon-carbon bond to form 5Z,8Z,11Z,14Z,17Z-eicosapentaenoyl-CoA (EPA-CoA, 5,8,11,14,17-20:5(n-3)). Delta-5-desaturase is required for this conversion. EPA-CoA has health benefits due to its anti-inflammatory actions. It is a precursor for the anti-inflammatory series-3 prostaglandins (PG), the series-5 leukotrienes (LT) and the series-3 thromboxanes (TA), which are anti-atherogenic and anti-thrombogenic (Ross et al. 2009).\"}]}" ;
