    mslm:evidenceJson "{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"compartment\": [{\"accession\": \"0005789\", \"className\": \"Compartment\", \"databaseName\": \"GO\", \"dbId\": 12045, \"definition\": \"The lipid bilayer surrounding the endoplasmic reticulum.\", \"displayName\": \"endoplasmic reticulum membrane\", \"name\": \"endoplasmic reticulum membrane\", \"schemaClass\": \"Compartment\", \"url\": \"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/QuickGO/term/GO:0005789\"}], \"dbId\": 209754, \"displayName\": \"Photolytic cleavage and thermal isomerization of 7-dehydroCHOL\", \"input\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"consumedByEvent\": [209754], \"dbId\": 6807057, \"displayName\": \"7-dehydroCHOL [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"7-dehydroCHOL\", \"cholesta-5,7-dien-3beta-ol\", \"7-dehydrocholesterol\", \"Provitamin D3\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-6807057\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-6807057.4\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Photolytic cleavage and thermal isomerization of 7-dehydroCHOL\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 8963870, \"displayName\": \"VD3 [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"VD3\", \"calciol\", \"Vitamin D3\", \"Cholecalciferol\"], \"producedByEvent\": [209754], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-8963870\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-8963870.4\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 6807053, \"displayName\": \"SC5D desaturates LTHSOL to 7-dehydroCHOL\", \"followingEvent\": [209754], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"SC5D desaturates LTHSOL to 7-dehydroCHOL\", \"lathosterol + 2 Fe(II)-(cytochrome b5) + O2 + 2 H(+) => 7-dehydrocholesterol + 2 Fe(III)-(cytochrome b5) + 2 H2O\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2015-12-15\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-6807053\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-6807053.4\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2008-06-30\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-209754\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-209754.5\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 209749, \"displayName\": \"The skin's exposure to UV rays from sunlight induces the pho...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"The skin's exposure to UV rays from sunlight induces the photolytic cleavage of 7-dehydrocholesterol to previtamin D3. This is followed by thermal isomerization to form vitamin D3 (VD3, cholecalciferol) (Holick et al. 1977).\"}]}" ;
