to 12-oxoLTB4 by PTGR1\", \"leukotriene B4 + NADP(+) => 12-oxo-leukotriene B4 + H(+) + NADPH\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 2142810, \"displayName\": \"12-oxoLTB4 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"12-oxoLTB4\", \"12-dehydro-leukotriene B4(1-)\", \"12-dehydro-leukotriene B4\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2161567], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-2142810\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-2142810.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29364, \"displayName\": \"NADPH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADPH\", \"NADPH(4-)\", \"TPNH\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2161567], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29364\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29364.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 70106, \"displayName\": \"H+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\", \"proton\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2161567], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-70106\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-70106.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 266072, \"displayName\": \"LTA4 is hydolysed to LTB4 by LTA4H\", \"followingEvent\": [2161567], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LTA4 is hydolysed to LTB4 by LTA4H\", \"H2O + leukotriene A4 => leukotriene B4\", \"LTA4 is hydrolyzed to LTB4\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2008-12-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-266072\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-266072.3\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-12-04\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2161567\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2161567.4\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 2161633, \"displayName\": \"Prostaglandin reductase 1 (PTGR1) aka LTB4DH metabolizes eic...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Prostaglandin reductase 1 (PTGR1) aka LTB4DH metabolizes eicosanoids by catalysing the oxidation of leukotriene B4 (LTB4) to form 12-oxo-Leukotriene B4 (12-oxoLTB4) aka 12-Keto-LTB4. The gene was originally cloned as leukotriene B4 12-hydroxydehydrogenase (LTB4DH) but was later discovered to have dual functionality as a prostaglandin reductase (Yokomizo et al. 1996).  This reaction has been inferred from a reaction in pigs (Yokomizo et al. 1993, Ensor et al. 1998).\"}]}" ;
