raded to 12S-HHT and MDA by TBXAS1\", \"prostaglandin H2 => (12S)-hydroxy-(5Z,8E,10E)-heptadecatrienoate + malonaldehyde\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-2161613\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-2161613.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10048452, \"displayName\": \"PGH2 is degraded to 12S-HHT and MDA by TBXAS1\", \"inferredFrom\": [2161613], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PGH2 is degraded to 12S-HHT and MDA by TBXAS1\", \"prostaglandin H2 => (12S)-hydroxy-(5Z,8E,10E)-heptadecatrienoate + malonaldehyde\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-2161613\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-2161613.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 2142797, \"displayName\": \"12S-HHT [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"12S-HHT\", \"12(S)-HHTrE(1-)\", \"12S-HHTrE\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2161613], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-2142797\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-2142797.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 2161562, \"displayName\": \"MDA [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"MDA\", \"malonaldehyde\", \"Malondialdehyde\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2161613], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-2161562\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-2161562.4\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 140359, \"displayName\": \"PGG2 is reduced to PGH2 by PTGS1\", \"followingEvent\": [2161613], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PGG2 is reduced to PGH2 by PTGS1\", \"AH2 + prostaglandin G2 = A + H2O + prostaglandin H2\", \"Peroxidative reduction of PGG2 to PGH2\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2008-06-30\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-140359\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-140359.3\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 2309773, \"displayName\": \"PGG2 is reduced to PGH2 by PTGS2\", \"followingEvent\": [2161613], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PGG2 is reduced to PGH2 by PTGS2\", \"AH2 + prostaglandin G2 = A + H2O + prostaglandin H2\", \"Peroxidative reduction of PGG2 to PGH2\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2008-06-30\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2309773\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2309773.8\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-12-04\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2161613\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2161613.4\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 2161573, \"displayName\": \"Thromboxane synthase (TBXAS1) aka CYP5A1 facilitates rearran...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Thromboxane synthase (TBXAS1) aka CYP5A1 facilitates rearrangement of the PGH2 endoperoxide bridge by a complementary mechanism to prostacyclin synthase, interacting with the C-9 oxygen to promote endoperoxide bond cleavage. The C-11 oxygen radical initiates intramolecular rearrangement, resulting in either the formation of thromboxane A2 (TXA2) or 12-hydroxyheptadecatrienoic acid (12S-HHT) and malonaldehyde (MDA) (Wang et al. 2001).\"}]}" ;
