ss\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2161701\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2161701.5\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-12-04\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2161614\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2161614.4\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 2161723, \"displayName\": \"Aldo-keto reductase family 1 member C3 (AKR1C3) aka PGFS is ...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Aldo-keto reductase family 1 member C3 (AKR1C3) aka PGFS is the enzyme involved in NADPH-dependent prostaglandin D2 11-keto reductase activity of reducing prostaglandin D2 (PGD2) to 11-epi-Prostaglandin F2alpha (11-epi-PGF2a) (Liston & Roberts 1985, Koda et al. 2004, Byrns et al. 2010).\"}]}" ;
