37478\", \"volume\": 275, \"year\": 2000}], \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"15k-LXA4 is reduced to dhk-LXA4 by PTGR1\", \"15-oxo-(5S,6R)-dihydroxy-(7E,9E,11Z,13E)-eicosatetraenoate + H(+) + NADH => 15-oxo-(5S,6R)-dihydroxy-(7E,9E,11Z)-eicosatrienoate + NAD(+)\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 2142690, \"displayName\": \"dhk-LXA4 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"dhk-LXA4\", \"13,14-dihydro-15-oxolipoxin A4(1-)\", \"13,14-dihydro-15-oxolipoxin A4\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2161844], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-2142690\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-2142690.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29360, \"displayName\": \"NAD+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NAD+\", \"NAD(1-)\", \"NAD\", \"NAD(+)\", \"Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide\", \"DPN\", \"Diphosphopyridine nucleotide\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2161844], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29360\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29360.6\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 2161779, \"displayName\": \"LXA4 is oxidised to 15k-LXA4 by HPGD\", \"followingEvent\": [2161844], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LXA4 is oxidised to 15k-LXA4 by HPGD\", \"lipoxin A4 + NAD(+) => 15-oxo-(5S,6R)-dihydroxy-(7E,9E,11Z,13E)-eicosatetraenoate + H(+) + NADH\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-03-13\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2161779\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2161779.5\"}], \"previousReviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821385, \"definition\": \"structure upated after externally reviewed and then internally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"four stars\", \"name\": [\"four stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"releaseDate\": \"2012-12-04\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2161844\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2161844.5\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 2161913, \"displayName\": \"Prostaglandin reductase 1 (PTGR1) aka LTB4DH, a 15-oxoprosta...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Prostaglandin reductase 1 (PTGR1) aka LTB4DH, a 15-oxoprostaglandin 13-reductase (Yokomizo et al. 1996), metabolises 15-oxo lipoxin A4 aka 15-keto-LXA4 (15k-LXA4) to produce 13,14-dihydro-15-keto-Lipoxin A4 (dhk-LXA4).  This reaction has been inferred from a reaction in pig (Clish et al. 2000).\"}]}" ;
