d to 15S-HpETE by ALOX15/15B\", \"inferredFrom\": [2162002], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Arachidonate is oxidised to 15S-HpETE by ALOX15/15B\", \"(5Z,8Z,11Z,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate + O2 => (15S)-hydroperoxy-(5Z,8Z,11Z,13E)-eicosatetraenoate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-2162002\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-2162002.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10283600, \"displayName\": \"Arachidonate is oxidised to 15S-HpETE by ALOX15/15B\", \"inferredFrom\": [2162002], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Arachidonate is oxidised to 15S-HpETE by ALOX15/15B\", \"(5Z,8Z,11Z,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate + O2 => (15S)-hydroperoxy-(5Z,8Z,11Z,13E)-eicosatetraenoate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-2162002\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-2162002.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10170533, \"displayName\": \"Arachidonate is oxidised to 15S-HpETE by ALOX15/15B\", \"inferredFrom\": [2162002], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Arachidonate is oxidised to 15S-HpETE by ALOX15/15B\", \"(5Z,8Z,11Z,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate + O2 => (15S)-hydroperoxy-(5Z,8Z,11Z,13E)-eicosatetraenoate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-2162002\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-2162002.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10048620, \"displayName\": \"Arachidonate is oxidised to 15S-HpETE by ALOX15/15B\", \"inferredFrom\": [2162002], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Arachidonate is oxidised to 15S-HpETE by ALOX15/15B\", \"(5Z,8Z,11Z,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate + O2 => (15S)-hydroperoxy-(5Z,8Z,11Z,13E)-eicosatetraenoate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-2162002\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-2162002.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 2142718, \"displayName\": \"15S-HpETE [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"15S-HpETE\", \"15(S)-HPETE(1-)\", \"15(S)-HPETE\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2162002], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-2142718\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-2142718.4\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 428990, \"displayName\": \"SLC27A1 transports arachidonate across the ER membrane\", \"followingEvent\": [2162002], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"SLC27A1 transports arachidonate across the ER membrane\", \"(5Z,8Z,11Z,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate(out) = (5Z,8Z,11Z,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate(in)\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-12-04\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-428990\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-428990.5\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-12-04\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2162002\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2162002.4\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 2162017, \"displayName\": \"Arachidonate 15-lipoxygenase (ALOX15) (Gulliksson et al. 200...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Arachidonate 15-lipoxygenase (ALOX15) (Gulliksson et al. 2007, Kuhn et al. 1993, Izumi et al. 1991) and arachidonate 15-lipoxygenase B (ALOX15B) (Tang et al. 2002, Wecksler et al. 2008) are lipid peroxidising enzymes mainly expressed in airway epithelial cells, eosinophils, reticulocytes and in macrophages.  They insert molecular oxygen at C-6 from the omega-end of arachidonate with formation of the unstable intermediate 15S-hydroperoxyeicosatetraenoic acid (15S-HpETE) which can be further converted, enzymatically or non-enzymatically, to 15S-hydroxyeicosatetraenoic acid (15S-HETE).\"}]}" ;
