:oxysterol [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"isChimeric\": false, \"maxDepth\": 3, \"name\": [\"INSIG:oxysterol\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Complex\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2317517\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2317517.1\"}, 2317517, 2317517, 2317517, {\"className\": \"Complex\", \"consumedByEvent\": [2317531], \"dbId\": 2317520, \"displayName\": \"SREBP1A,1C,2:SCAP [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"isChimeric\": false, \"maxDepth\": 3, \"name\": [\"SREBP1A,1C,2:SCAP\", \"SREBF1A,1C,2:SCAP\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Complex\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2317520\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2317520.1\"}], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"SREBP1A,1C,2 binds SCAP:INSIG:oxysterol and is retained in the endoplasmic reticulum\", \"SREBF1A,1C,2 binds SCAP:INSIG:oxysterol and is retained in the endoplasmic reticulum\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Complex\", \"dbId\": 2317522, \"displayName\": \"SREBP1A,1C,2:SCAP:INSIG:oxysterol [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"isChimeric\": false, \"maxDepth\": 4, \"name\": [\"SREBP1A,1C,2:SCAP:INSIG:oxysterol\", \"SREBF1A,1C,2:SCAP:INSIG:oxysterol\"], \"producedByEvent\": [2317531], \"schemaClass\": \"Complex\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2317522\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2317522.1\"}], \"previousReviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821385, \"definition\": \"structure upated after externally reviewed and then internally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"four stars\", \"name\": [\"four stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"releaseDate\": \"2012-09-18\", \"releaseStatus\": \"UPDATED\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2317531\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2317531.4\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 2317535, \"displayName\": \"INSIG binds oxysterols and the INSIG:oxysterol complex inter...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"INSIG binds oxysterols and the INSIG:oxysterol complex interacts with SCAP subunits of the SREBP1A/1C/2:SCAP (SREBF1A/1C/2:SCAP) complex. This interaction retains the SREBP1A/1C/2:SCAP:INSIG:oxysterol complex in the endoplasmic reticulum. The order of assembly of the SREBP1A/1C/2:SCAP:INSIG:oxysterol complex is unknown.\"}]}" ;
