ns\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2426147\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2426147.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 2426235, \"displayName\": \"SREBP1A/1C/2 (SREBF1A/1C/2), together with NF-Y, bind and tr...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"SREBP1A/1C/2 (SREBF1A/1C/2), together with NF-Y, bind and transactivate the promoter of the FDPS gene (Ericsson et al. 1996, Pai et al. 1998, Amemiya-Kudo et al. 2002, Reed et al. 2008, Rome et al. 2008, Ishimoto et al. 2010). The binding of NF-Y synergistically enhances the binding of SREBP1 (Ericsson et al. 1996). SREBP1A activates FDPS more strongly than does SREBP2 or SREBP1C (Amemiya-Kudo et al. 2002).\"}]}" ;
