vitamin D(3)\", \"journal\": \"Ther Apher Dial\", \"pages\": \"14-7\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 21595846, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Role of megalin and cubilin in the metabolism of vitamin D(3)\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21595846\", \"volume\": 15, \"year\": 2011}], \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LRP2-mediated uptake of extracellular CUBN:GC:25(OH)D\"], \"orthologousEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10362218, \"displayName\": \"LRP2-mediated uptake of extracellular CUBN:GC:25(OH)D\", \"inferredFrom\": [350168], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LRP2-mediated uptake of extracellular CUBN:GC:25(OH)D\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-350168\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-350168.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10135543, \"displayName\": \"LRP2-mediated uptake of extracellular CUBN:GC:25(OH)D\", \"inferredFrom\": [350168], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LRP2-mediated uptake of extracellular CUBN:GC:25(OH)D\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-350168\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-350168.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Complex\", \"dbId\": 350092, \"displayName\": \"CUBN:GC:25(OH)D [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 3, \"name\": [\"CUBN:GC:25(OH)D\"], \"producedByEvent\": [350168], \"schemaClass\": \"Complex\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-350092\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-350092.3\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 350186, \"displayName\": \"CUBN binds GC:25(OH)D\", \"followingEvent\": [350168], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CUBN binds GC:25(OH)D\", \"DBP:Calcidiol is sequestered by cubilin on the cell surface\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2008-06-30\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-350186\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-350186.4\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2008-06-30\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-350168\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-350168.7\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 350154, \"displayName\": \"Megalin (LRP2, glycoprotein 330) is a member of the low dens...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Megalin (LRP2, glycoprotein 330) is a member of the low density lipoprotein receptor family and is abundant in kidney proximal tubules (Kounnas et al. 1995, Hjalm et al. 1996). LRP2 complexed with LDLRAP1 (low density lipoprotein receptor adapter protein 1, aka ARH) mediates the endocytic uptake of GC:25(OH)D complexes, thereby preventing the loss of 25-hydroxyvitamin D (calcidiol, 25(OH)D) in urine (Nykjaer  et al. 1999, Kaseda et al. 2011).\"}]}" ;
