"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-389609\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-389609.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10140756, \"displayName\": \"ALDH3A2-2 oxidizes pristanal to pristanate\", \"inferredFrom\": [389609], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALDH3A2-2 oxidizes pristanal to pristanate\", \"pristanal + NAD+ => pristanate + NADH + H+\", \"2,6,10,14-tetramethylpentadecanal + H2O + NAD(+) => 2,6,10,14-tetramethylpentadecanoate + 2 H(+) + NADH\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-389609\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-389609.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10018625, \"displayName\": \"ALDH3A2-2 oxidizes pristanal to pristanate\", \"inferredFrom\": [389609], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALDH3A2-2 oxidizes pristanal to pristanate\", \"pristanal + NAD+ => pristanate + NADH + H+\", \"2,6,10,14-tetramethylpentadecanal + H2O + NAD(+) => 2,6,10,14-tetramethylpentadecanoate + 2 H(+) + NADH\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-389609\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-389609.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 6811612, \"displayName\": \"pristanate [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"pristanate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [389609], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-6811612\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-6811612.2\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 192305, \"displayName\": \"NADH [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADH\", \"NADH(2-)\"], \"producedByEvent\": [389609], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-192305\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-192305.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 193465, \"displayName\": \"H+ [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\"], \"producedByEvent\": [389609, 389609], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-193465\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-193465.3\"}, 193465], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 389611, \"displayName\": \"2-hydroxyphytanoyl-CoA => pristanal + formyl-CoA\", \"followingEvent\": [389609], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"2-hydroxyphytanoyl-CoA => pristanal + formyl-CoA\", \"2-hydroxyphytanoyl-CoA => 2,6,10,14-tetramethylpentadecanal + formyl-CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2009-04-01\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-389611\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-389611.3\"}], \"previousReviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821385, \"definition\": \"structure upated after externally reviewed and then internally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"four stars\", \"name\": [\"four stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"releaseDate\": \"2009-04-01\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-389609\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-389609.4\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 389610, \"displayName\": \"Peroxisomal ALDH3A2-2 (fatty aldehyde dehydrogenase family 3...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Peroxisomal ALDH3A2-2 (fatty aldehyde dehydrogenase family 3 member A2, isoform 2) catalyzes the NAD-dependent dehydrogenation of pristanal to form pristanate (Jansen et al. 2001; Kelson et al. 1997; Rizzo et al. 2001). Structural studies suggest that the enzyme is a homodimer (Keller et al. 2010), and expression studies of the homologous mouse proteins in cultured cells indicate that ALDH3A2 isoform 2 is localized to peroxisomes while isoform 1 is localized to the endoplasmic reticulum (Ashibe et al. 2007).\"}]}" ;
