ristanoyl-CoA + O2 => (2E)-pristenoyl-CoA + H2O2\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-389891\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-389891.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 389894, \"displayName\": \"trans-2,3-dehydropristanoyl-CoA [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"trans-2,3-dehydropristanoyl-CoA\", \"(E)-2,3-didehydropristanoyl-CoA(4-)\", \"(E)-2,3-didehydropristanoyl-CoA\"], \"producedByEvent\": [389891], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-389894\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-389894.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 113575, \"displayName\": \"H2O2 [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H2O2\", \"hydrogen peroxide\"], \"producedByEvent\": [389891], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-113575\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-113575.3\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 389897, \"displayName\": \"Isomerization of (2R)-pristanoyl-CoA to (2S)-pristanoyl-CoA\", \"followingEvent\": [389891], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Isomerization of (2R)-pristanoyl-CoA to (2S)-pristanoyl-CoA\", \"(2R)-pristanoyl-CoA => (2S)-pristanoyl-CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2009-04-01\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-389897\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-389897.3\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2009-04-01\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-389891\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-389891.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 389896, \"displayName\": \"Peroxisomal ACOX3 catalyzes the reaction of (2S)-pristanoyl-...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Peroxisomal ACOX3 catalyzes the reaction of (2S)-pristanoyl-CoA and O2 to form trans-2,3-dehydropristanoyl-CoA and H2O2. ACOX3 protein and enzyme activity have been observed in prostate tumors, but are undetectable in normal prostate tissue as well as in liver and kidney (where ACOX2 catalyzes the oxidation of pristanoyl-CoA) (Zha et al. 2005; Vanhooren et al. 1997). The physiological consequences of this differential gene expression are unknown.\"}]}" ;
