SA-390425.4\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 390417, \"displayName\": \"Peroxisomal fatty acyl-CoA reductase 1 (FAR1) catalyzes the ...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Peroxisomal fatty acyl-CoA reductase 1 (FAR1) catalyzes the reaction of palmitoyl-CoA (PalmCoA) and 2 NADPH + 2 H+ to form hexadecanol (HXOL), CoASH, and 2 NADP+. As judged from mRNA levels, FAR1 is widely expressed in the body (Cheng and Russell 2004).\"}]}" ;
