SA-390438.4\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 390411, \"displayName\": \"Peroxisomal fatty acyl-CoA reductase 2 (FAR2) catalyzes the ...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Peroxisomal fatty acyl-CoA reductase 2 (FAR2) catalyzes the reaction of palmitoyl-CoA (PalmCoA) and 2 NADPH + 2 H+ to form hexadecanol (HXOL), CoASH, and 2 NADP+. As judged from mRNA levels, FAR2 is not widely expressed in the body but is abundant in brain (Cheng and Russell 2004).\"}]}" ;
