"definition\": \"structure upated after externally reviewed and then internally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"four stars\", \"name\": [\"four stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"releaseDate\": \"2009-09-30\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"BlackBoxEvent\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-400183\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-400183.4\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 400189, \"displayName\": \"In the absence of activating ligands of PPAR-alpha, the PPAR...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"In the absence of activating ligands of PPAR-alpha, the PPAR-alpha:RXR-alpha heterodimers recruit corepressors NCoR1, NCoR2(SMRT), and histone deacetylases (HDACs) to genes regulated by PPAR-alpha. The corepressors maintain chromatin at the gene in an inactive conformation and prevent expression of the gene.\"}]}" ;
