tion with VAMP-associated protein (VAP) for inter-organelle trafficking of ceramide in mammalian cells\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/24569996\", \"volume\": 289, \"year\": 2014}, {\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 9843190, \"displayName\": \"Integration of non-vesicular and vesicular transport processes at the Golgi complex by the PKD-CERT network\", \"journal\": \"Biochim Biophys Acta\", \"pages\": \"1096-103\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 22226883, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Integration of non-vesicular and vesicular transport processes at the Golgi complex by the PKD-CERT network\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/22226883\", \"volume\": 1821, \"year\": 2012}], \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PRKD1,2,3 phosphorylates CERT1-2\", \"CERT + ATP => monophospho-CERT + ADP\"], \"orthologousEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10945189, \"displayName\": \"PRKD1,2,3 phosphorylates CERT1-2\", \"inferredFrom\": [429698], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PRKD1,2,3 phosphorylates CERT1-2\", \"CERT + ATP => monophospho-CERT + ADP\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Caenorhabditis elegans\", \"stId\": \"R-CEL-429698\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CEL-429698.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10859787, \"displayName\": \"PRKD1,2,3 phosphorylates CERT1-2\", \"inferredFrom\": [429698], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PRKD1,2,3 phosphorylates CERT1-2\", \"CERT + ATP => monophospho-CERT + ADP\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Drosophila melanogaster\", \"stId\": \"R-DME-429698\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DME-429698.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10592332, \"displayName\": \"PRKD1,2,3 phosphorylates CERT1-2\", \"inferredFrom\": [429698], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PRKD1,2,3 phosphorylates CERT1-2\", \"CERT + ATP => monophospho-CERT + ADP\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Danio rerio\", \"stId\": \"R-DRE-429698\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DRE-429698.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10370431, \"displayName\": \"PRKD1,2,3 phosphorylates CERT1-2\", \"inferredFrom\": [429698], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PRKD1,2,3 phosphorylates CERT1-2\", \"CERT + ATP => monophospho-CERT + ADP\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-429698\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-429698.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29370, \"displayName\": \"ADP [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ADP\", \"ADP(3-)\", \"Adenosine 5'-diphosphate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [429698], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29370\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29370.6\"}, {\"className\": \"Genes and Transcripts\", \"dbId\": 429704, \"displayName\": \"p-S132-CERT1-2 [cytosol]\", \"endCoordinate\": 598, \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"p-S132-CERT1-2\", \"p-S132-COL4A3BP-2\", \"monophospho-CERT\", \"COL4A3BP\", \"GPBPdelta26\"], \"producedByEvent\": [429698], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceIsoform\", \"schemaClass\": \"EntityWithAccessionedSequence\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-429704\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-429704.3\", \"startCoordinate\": 1}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 70106, \"displayName\": \"H+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\", \"proton\"], \"producedByEvent\": [429698], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-70106\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-70106.5\"}], \"previousReviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821384, \"definition\": \"structure updated after externally and internally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"two stars\", \"name\": [\"two stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"releaseDate\": \"2009-09-30\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-429698\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-429698.7\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 429690, \"displayName\": \"Cytosolic PRKD1, 2, and 3 (protein kinase D1, D2, and D3) ca...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Cytosolic PRKD1, 2, and 3 (protein kinase D1, D2, and D3) catalyze the phosphorylation of serine residue 132 of isoform 2 of ceramide transfer protein (CERT1-2, aka COL4A3BP-2). Protein kinase D (PRKD) is a crucial regulator of secretory transport at the trans-Golgi network (TGN). Phosphorylation of COL4A3BP-2 reduces its ceramide transfer activity. PRKDs may, therefore, act as regulators of lipid homeostasis (Fugmann et al., 2007; Kumagai et al., 2014; Shimasaki et al., 2022; reviewed by Olayioye & Hausser, 2011; Kumagai & Hanada, 2019).\"}]}" ;
