icus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-5692261\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-5692261.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10068902, \"displayName\": \"ALDH3A2-1 oxidises HD2NAL to PALM\", \"inferredFrom\": [5692261], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALDH3A2-1 oxidises HD2NAL to PALM\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-5692261\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-5692261.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 70106, \"displayName\": \"H+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\", \"proton\"], \"producedByEvent\": [5692261], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-70106\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-70106.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 73473, \"displayName\": \"NADH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADH\", \"NADH(2-)\"], \"producedByEvent\": [5692261], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-73473\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-73473.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 3632881, \"displayName\": \"PALM [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PALM\", \"hexadecanoate\", \"palmitate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [5692261], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-3632881\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-3632881.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 428681, \"displayName\": \"PXLP-SGPL1 cleaves sphingoid-1-phosphates\", \"followingEvent\": [5692261], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PXLP-SGPL1 cleaves sphingoid-1-phosphates\", \"sphinganine 1-phosphate => phosphoethanolamine + hexadecanal\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2009-09-30\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-428681\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-428681.4\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2015-09-22\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-5692261\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-5692261.6\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 5692252, \"displayName\": \"Fatty aldehyde dehydrogenase family 3 member A2, isoform 1 (...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Fatty aldehyde dehydrogenase family 3 member A2, isoform 1 (ALDH3A2-1) in the endoplasmic reticulum membrane can catalyse the oxidation of long-chain aliphatic aldehydes to fatty acids (Kelson et al. 1997; Rizzo et al. 2001). Structural studies suggest that the enzyme is a homodimer (Keller et al. 2010), and expression studies of the homologous mouse proteins in cultured cells indicate that ALDH3A2 isoform 1 to the endoplasmic reticulum while isoform 2 is localized to peroxisomes (Ashibe et al. 2007). The sphingosine 1-phosphate (S1P) degradation product hexadec-2-enal (HD2NAL) can be oxidised to hexadecenoic acid (palmitic acid, PALM) (Nakahara et al. 2012). Defective ALDH3A2 results in Sjoegren-Larsson syndrome (SLS; MIM:270200), a neurocutaneous disorder characterised by a combination of severe mental retardation, spastic di- or tetraplegia and congenital ichthyosis. Accumulation of the S1P metabolite HD2NAL contributes to the pathogenesis of SLS (De Laurenzi et al. 1996, Sillen et al. 1998).\"}]}" ;
