, \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-5693390\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-5693390.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 5693408, \"displayName\": \"Estradiol 17-beta-dehydrogenase 11 (HSD17B11) may participat...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Estradiol 17-beta-dehydrogenase 11 (HSD17B11) may participate in androgen metabolism during steroidogenesis where it dehydrogenates estradiol-17-beta (EST17b) to estrone (E1) (Chai et al. 2003).\"}]}" ;
