acids\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-5693761\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-5693761.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29356, \"displayName\": \"H2O [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H2O\", \"water\"], \"producedByEvent\": [5693761], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29356\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29356.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9843201, \"displayName\": \"2-OH FA [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"2-OH FA\", \"(2R)-2-hydroxy fatty acid anion\"], \"producedByEvent\": [5693761], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9843201\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9843201.2\"}, {\"className\": \"Complex\", \"dbId\": 9842694, \"displayName\": \"CYB5B:Fe3+ [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 2, \"name\": [\"CYB5B:Fe3+\", \"ferric CYB5B\"], \"producedByEvent\": [5693761, 5693761], \"schemaClass\": \"Complex\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9842694\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9842694.1\"}, 9842694], \"previousReviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821384, \"definition\": \"structure updated after externally and internally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"two stars\", \"name\": [\"two stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"releaseDate\": \"2015-09-22\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-5693761\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-5693761.4\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 5693777, \"displayName\": \"Fatty acid 2-hydroxylase (FA2H), an ER membrane-associated e...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Fatty acid 2-hydroxylase (FA2H), an ER membrane-associated enzyme, catalyzes the cytochrome b5-dependent hydroxylation of free fatty acids on the saturated C2 position. 2-Hydroxylation of free fatty acids occurs before de novo ceramide synthesis. In mammals, 2-hydroxysphingolipids are abundant in the brain as components of the myelin lipids galactosylceramides and sulfatides (Alderson et al., 2004; Uchida et al., 2007; Guo et al., 2012; reviewed by Hama, 2009). Deficiency in FA2H causes a form of spastic paraplegia (SPG35, MIM:612319). A low expression level of FA2H correlates with a poor prognosis in many cancers (reviewed by Eckhardt, 2023).\"}]}" ;
