ew long chain acyl-CoA dehydrogenases\", \"journal\": \"Mol. Genet. Metab.\", \"pages\": \"418-29\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 21237683, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Identification and characterization of new long chain acyl-CoA dehydrogenases\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21237683\", \"volume\": 102, \"year\": 2011}], \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ACAD10 dehydrogenates S-2MPDA-CoA\"], \"orthologousEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10979368, \"displayName\": \"ACAD10 dehydrogenates S-2MPDA-CoA\", \"inferredFrom\": [5695980], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ACAD10 dehydrogenates S-2MPDA-CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Caenorhabditis elegans\", \"stId\": \"R-CEL-5695980\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CEL-5695980.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10529638, \"displayName\": \"ACAD10 dehydrogenates S-2MPDA-CoA\", \"inferredFrom\": [5695980], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ACAD10 dehydrogenates S-2MPDA-CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-5695980\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-5695980.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10415586, \"displayName\": \"ACAD10 dehydrogenates S-2MPDA-CoA\", \"inferredFrom\": [5695980], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ACAD10 dehydrogenates S-2MPDA-CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-5695980\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-5695980.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10069837, \"displayName\": \"ACAD10 dehydrogenates S-2MPDA-CoA\", \"inferredFrom\": [5695980], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ACAD10 dehydrogenates S-2MPDA-CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-5695980\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-5695980.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 5695949, \"displayName\": \"S-2MDPDA-CoA [mitochondrial matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"S-2MDPDA-CoA\", \"2-methylpentadec-2-enoyl-CoA\", \"S-2-methyl-2,3-dehydropentadecenoyl-CoA\"], \"producedByEvent\": [5695980], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-5695949\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-5695949.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 31649, \"displayName\": \"FADH2 [mitochondrial matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"FADH2\", \"FADH2(2-)\"], \"producedByEvent\": [5695980], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-31649\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-31649.3\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2015-09-22\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-5695980\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-5695980.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 5695970, \"displayName\": \"Acyl-CoA dehydrogenase family member 10 (ACAD10) is a mitoch...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Acyl-CoA dehydrogenase family member 10 (ACAD10) is a mitochondrial enzyme that can catalyse the alpha, beta-dehydrogenation of acyl-CoA esters. ACAD10 shows highest expression in foetal brain and is shown to be active only on S-2-methylpentadecenoyl-CoA (S-2MPDA-CoA), a C15 acyl-CoA. The S isomer is dehydrogenated to its respective 2,3-dehydroacyl-CoA product, S-2methyl-2,3-dehydropentadecenoyl-CoA (S-2MDPDA) (He et al. 2011).\"}]}" ;
