uman and rat peroxisome proliferator activated receptors (PPARs) demonstrate similar tissue distribution but different responsiveness to PPAR activators\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/7981125\", \"volume\": 51, \"year\": 1994}, {\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 561153, \"displayName\": \"Comparative analysis of gene regulation by the transcription factor PPARalpha between mouse and human\", \"journal\": \"PLoS One\", \"pages\": \"e6796\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 19710929, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Comparative analysis of gene regulation by the transcription factor PPARalpha between mouse and human\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19710929\", \"volume\": 4, \"year\": 2009}], \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Expression of PPARA\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Protein\", \"dbId\": 400186, \"displayName\": \"PPARA [nucleoplasm]\", \"endCoordinate\": 468, \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PPARA\", \"Peroxisome proliferator-activated receptor alpha\", \"PPAR-alpha\"], \"producedByEvent\": [879724], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceGeneProduct\", \"schemaClass\": \"EntityWithAccessionedSequence\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-400186\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-400186.1\", \"startCoordinate\": 1}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 5663156, \"displayName\": \"p-S90-BMAL1:p-T451,T461-CLOCK binds PPARA gene\", \"followingEvent\": [879724], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"p-S90-BMAL1:p-T451,T461-CLOCK binds PPARA gene\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2015-03-19\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-5663156\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-5663156.4\"}, {\"category\": \"uncertain\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 400143, \"displayName\": \"Fatty acid ligands activate PPARA\", \"followingEvent\": [879724], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Fatty acid ligands activate PPARA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2009-09-30\", \"schemaClass\": \"BlackBoxEvent\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-400143\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-400143.4\"}], \"regulatedBy\": [{\"className\": \"PositiveGeneExpressionRegulation\", \"dbId\": 879833, \"displayName\": \"Positive gene expression regulation by 'p-S90-BMAL1:p-T451,T461-CLOCK:PPARA gene [nucleoplasm]'\", \"regulatedEntity\": [879724], \"schemaClass\": \"PositiveGeneExpressionRegulation\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-879833\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-879833.3\"}, {\"className\": \"PositiveGeneExpressionRegulation\", \"dbId\": 1989805, \"displayName\": \"Positive gene expression regulation by 'PPARA:RXRA Coactivator complex [nucleoplasm]'\", \"regulatedEntity\": [879724], \"schemaClass\": \"PositiveGeneExpressionRegulation\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1989805\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1989805.1\"}], \"regulationReference\": [{\"className\": \"RegulationReference\", \"dbId\": 9641251, \"displayName\": \"Positive gene expression regulation by 'PPARA:RXRA Coactivator complex [nucleoplasm]' Comparative analysis of gene regulation by the transcription factor PPARalpha between mouse and human\", \"schemaClass\": \"RegulationReference\"}, {\"className\": \"RegulationReference\", \"dbId\": 9642007, \"displayName\": \"Positive gene expression regulation by 'p-BMAL1:p-CLOCK,NPAS2:PPARA gene [nucleoplasm]' CLOCK is involved in the circadian transactivation of peroxisome-proliferator-activated receptor alpha (PPARalpha) in mice\", \"schemaClass\": \"RegulationReference\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2010-09-21\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"BlackBoxEvent\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-879724\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-879724.6\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 879711, \"displayName\": \"The PPARA gene is transcribed to yield mRNA and the mRNA is ...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"The PPARA gene is transcribed to yield mRNA and the mRNA is translated to yield protein. As inferred from mouse, BMAL1:CLOCK (ARNTL:CLOCK) heterodimers bind E-box elements in the second intron of the PPARA gene and activate transcription of PPARA.\"}]}" ;
