"Complex\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-8866926\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-8866926.4\"}], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"literatureReference\": [{\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 8858271, \"displayName\": \"Pathophysiology of lipid droplet proteins in liver diseases\", \"journal\": \"Exp. Cell Res.\", \"pages\": \"187-92\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 26515554, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Pathophysiology of lipid droplet proteins in liver diseases\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/26515554\", \"volume\": 340, \"year\": 2016}, {\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 8858287, \"displayName\": \"Hypoxia-inducible protein 2 is a novel lipid droplet protein and a specific target gene of hypoxia-inducible factor-1\", \"journal\": \"FASEB J.\", \"pages\": \"4443-58\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 20624928, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Hypoxia-inducible protein 2 is a novel lipid droplet protein and a specific target gene of hypoxia-inducible factor-1\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/20624928\", \"volume\": 24, \"year\": 2010}], \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HILPDA binds lipid droplets\"], \"orthologousEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10541702, \"displayName\": \"HILPDA binds lipid droplets\", \"inferredFrom\": [8858270], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HILPDA binds lipid droplets\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-8858270\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-8858270.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10314602, \"displayName\": \"HILPDA binds lipid droplets\", \"inferredFrom\": [8858270], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HILPDA binds lipid droplets\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-8858270\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-8858270.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10082918, \"displayName\": \"HILPDA binds lipid droplets\", \"inferredFrom\": [8858270], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HILPDA binds lipid droplets\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-8858270\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-8858270.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Complex\", \"dbId\": 8858282, \"displayName\": \"HILPDA:lipid droplet [lipid droplet]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"isChimeric\": false, \"maxDepth\": 3, \"name\": [\"HILPDA:lipid droplet\"], \"producedByEvent\": [8858270], \"schemaClass\": \"Complex\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-8858282\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-8858282.3\"}], \"previousReviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821385, \"definition\": \"structure upated after externally reviewed and then internally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"four stars\", \"name\": [\"four stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"releaseDate\": \"2016-06-15\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-8858270\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-8858270.4\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 8858279, \"displayName\": \"Hypoxia-inducible lipid droplet-associated protein (HILPDA a...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Hypoxia-inducible lipid droplet-associated protein (HILPDA aka HIG2) was first described as a novel gene inducible by hypoxia and glucose deprivation, but its function and mechanisms of regulation remain unknown.  HILPDA is a novel lipid droplet (LD) protein and stimulates intracellular lipid accumulation, which may play an important functional role in diseases associated with pathological lipid accumulation (Gimm et al. 2010, Carr & Ahima 2016).\"}]}" ;
