-serine\", \"Phosphatidylserine\", \"phosphatidyl-L-serine\", \"1,2-Diacyl-sn-glycerol 3-phospho-L-serine\", \"3-O-sn-Phosphatidyl-L-serine\", \"O3-Phosphatidyl-L-serine\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-33625\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-33625.5\"}], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"literatureReference\": [{\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 8869420, \"displayName\": \"An alternative splicing form of phosphatidylserine-specific phospholipase A1 that exhibits lysophosphatidylserine-specific lysophospholipase activity in humans\", \"journal\": \"J. Biol. Chem.\", \"pages\": \"11053-9\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 10196188, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"An alternative splicing form of phosphatidylserine-specific phospholipase A1 that exhibits lysophosphatidylserine-specific lysophospholipase activity in humans\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/10196188\", \"volume\": 274, \"year\": 1999}, {\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 8869430, \"displayName\": \"Structure and function of extracellular phospholipase A1 belonging to the pancreatic lipase gene family\", \"journal\": \"Biochimie\", \"pages\": \"197-204\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 17101204, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Structure and function of extracellular phospholipase A1 belonging to the pancreatic lipase gene family\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/17101204\", \"volume\": 89, \"year\": 2007}], \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PLA1A hydrolyses PS to 2-acyl LPS\"], \"orthologousEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10903463, \"displayName\": \"PLA1A hydrolyses PS to 2-acyl LPS\", \"inferredFrom\": [8869425], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PLA1A hydrolyses PS to 2-acyl LPS\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Drosophila melanogaster\", \"stId\": \"R-DME-8869425\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DME-8869425.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10815261, \"displayName\": \"PLA1A hydrolyses PS to 2-acyl LPS\", \"inferredFrom\": [8869425], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PLA1A hydrolyses PS to 2-acyl LPS\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Gallus gallus\", \"stId\": \"R-GGA-8869425\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-GGA-8869425.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10638759, \"displayName\": \"PLA1A hydrolyses PS to 2-acyl LPS\", \"inferredFrom\": [8869425], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PLA1A hydrolyses PS to 2-acyl LPS\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Danio rerio\", \"stId\": \"R-DRE-8869425\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DRE-8869425.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10543199, \"displayName\": \"PLA1A hydrolyses PS to 2-acyl LPS\", \"inferredFrom\": [8869425], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PLA1A hydrolyses PS to 2-acyl LPS\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-8869425\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-8869425.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10316004, \"displayName\": \"PLA1A hydrolyses PS to 2-acyl LPS\", \"inferredFrom\": [8869425], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PLA1A hydrolyses PS to 2-acyl LPS\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-8869425\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-8869425.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10207443, \"displayName\": \"PLA1A hydrolyses PS to 2-acyl LPS\", \"inferredFrom\": [8869425], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PLA1A hydrolyses PS to 2-acyl LPS\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-8869425\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-8869425.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10084449, \"displayName\": \"PLA1A hydrolyses PS to 2-acyl LPS\", \"inferredFrom\": [8869425], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PLA1A hydrolyses PS to 2-acyl LPS\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-8869425\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-8869425.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 8869427, \"displayName\": \"2-acyl LPS [plasma membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"2-acyl LPS\", \"2-acyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphoserine\", \"2-acyl lysophosphatidylserine\"], \"producedByEvent\": [8869425], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-8869427\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-8869427.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 1602366, \"displayName\": \"LCFA(-) [plasma membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LCFA(-)\", \"long-chain fatty acid anion\"], \"producedByEvent\": [8869425], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-1602366\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1602366.4\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2016-09-19\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-8869425\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-8869425.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 8869434, \"displayName\": \"Phospholipase A1 member A (PLA1A, aka PS-PLA1) is a widely e...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Phospholipase A1 member A (PLA1A, aka PS-PLA1) is a widely expressed, extracellular protein belonging to the pancreatic lipase family. Phospholipases are conserved in a wide range of organisms. PLA1A specifically hydrolyses PS to produce its corresponding lysophospholipid 2-acyl LPS. Lysophospholipids in general can act as lipid mediators with multiple biological functions so PLA1A could play an important role in mediating 2-acyl LPS production (Nagai et al. 1999, Aoki et al. 2007).\"}]}" ;
