lipin to PA and PG\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Dictyostelium discoideum\", \"stId\": \"R-DDI-8954398\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DDI-8954398.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10907997, \"displayName\": \"PLD6 dimer hydrolyses cardiolipin to PA and PG\", \"inferredFrom\": [8954398], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PLD6 dimer hydrolyses cardiolipin to PA and PG\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Drosophila melanogaster\", \"stId\": \"R-DME-8954398\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DME-8954398.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10820089, \"displayName\": \"PLD6 dimer hydrolyses cardiolipin to PA and PG\", \"inferredFrom\": [8954398], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PLD6 dimer hydrolyses cardiolipin to PA and PG\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Gallus gallus\", \"stId\": \"R-GGA-8954398\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-GGA-8954398.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10725419, \"displayName\": \"PLD6 dimer hydrolyses cardiolipin to PA and PG\", \"inferredFrom\": [8954398], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PLD6 dimer hydrolyses cardiolipin to PA and PG\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"stId\": \"R-XTR-8954398\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-XTR-8954398.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10642954, \"displayName\": \"PLD6 dimer hydrolyses cardiolipin to PA and PG\", \"inferredFrom\": [8954398], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PLD6 dimer hydrolyses cardiolipin to PA and PG\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reactio