\"Chemical Compound\", \"consumedByEvent\": [8959462], \"dbId\": 9843232, \"displayName\": \"C16DH CER [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"C16DH CER\", \"N-hexadecanoylsphinganine\", \"Cer(d18:0/16:0)\", \"N-palmitoylsphinganine\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9843232\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9843232.2\"}], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"literatureReference\": [{\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 8959484, \"displayName\": \"Sphingomyelin synthase-related protein SMSr controls ceramide homeostasis in the ER\", \"journal\": \"J. Cell Biol.\", \"pages\": \"1013-27\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 19506037, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Sphingomyelin synthase-related protein SMSr controls ceramide homeostasis in the ER\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19506037\", \"volume\": 185, \"year\": 2009}, {\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 9843239, \"displayName\": \"Ceramide phosphoethanolamine, an enigmatic cellular membrane sphingolipid\", \"journal\": \"Biochim Biophys Acta Biomembr\", \"pages\": \"1284-1292\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 31067435, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Ceramide phosphoethanolamine, an enigmatic cellular membrane sphingolipid\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/31067435\", \"volume\": 1861, \"year\": 2019}, {\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 9843231, \"displayName\": \"ER residency of the ceramide phosphoethanolamine synthase SMSr relies on homotypic oligomerization mediated by its SAM domain\", \"journal\": \"Sci Rep\", \"pages\": \"41290\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 28120887, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"ER residency of the ceramide phosphoethanolamine synthase SMSr relies on homotypic oligomerization mediated by its SAM domain\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nl