\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"stId\": \"R-XTR-9020261\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-XTR-9020261.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10645084, \"displayName\": \"Ac-PTGS2 dimer oxidises DHA to 17(R)-Hp-DHA\", \"inferredFrom\": [9020261], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Ac-PTGS2 dimer oxidises DHA to 17(R)-Hp-DHA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Danio rerio\", \"stId\": \"R-DRE-9020261\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DRE-9020261.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10550910, \"displayName\": \"Ac-PTGS2 dimer oxidises DHA to 17(R)-Hp-DHA\", \"inferredFrom\": [9020261], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Ac-PTGS2 dimer oxidises DHA to 17(R)-Hp-DHA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-9020261\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-9020261.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10437487, \"displayName\": \"Ac-PTGS2 dimer oxidises DHA to 17(R)-Hp-DHA\", \"inferredFrom\": [9020261], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Ac-PTGS2 dimer oxidises DHA to 17(R)-Hp-DHA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-9020261\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-9020261.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10323599, \"displayName\": \"Ac-PTGS2 dimer oxidises DHA to 17(R)-Hp-DHA\", \"inferredFrom\": [9020261], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Ac-PTGS2 dimer oxidises DHA to 17(R)-Hp-DHA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-9020261\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-9020261.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10215715, \"displayName\": \"Ac-PTGS2 dimer oxidises DHA to 17(R)-Hp-DHA\", \"inferredFrom\": [9020261], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Ac-PTGS2 dimer oxidises DHA to 17(R)-Hp-DHA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-9020261\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-9020261.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10092490, \"displayName\": \"Ac-PTGS2 dimer oxidises DHA to 17(R)-Hp-DHA\", \"inferredFrom\": [9020261], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Ac-PTGS2 dimer oxidises DHA to 17(R)-Hp-DHA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9020261\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9020261.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9024522, \"displayName\": \"17(R)-Hp-DHA [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"17(R)-Hp-DHA\", \"(4Z,7Z,10Z,13Z,15E,17R,19Z)-17-hydroperoxydocosahexaenoate\", \"17(R)-hydroperoxy-docosahexaenoic acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9020261], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9024522\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9024522.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 2314686, \"displayName\": \"ASA- acetylates PTGS2\", \"followingEvent\": [9020261], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ASA- acetylates PTGS2\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2011-12-06\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-2314686\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-2314686.4\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9020261\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9020261.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9024477, \"displayName\": \"Normally, cyclooxygenases (COX) carry out stereospecific oxy...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Normally, cyclooxygenases (COX) carry out stereospecific oxygenation of arachidonic acid to generate prostaglandins. When treated with aspirin (acetylsalicylic acid, ASA), dimeric cyclooxygenase-2 (COX2, PTGS2 dimer) can be acetylated. ASA covalently modifies PTGS2 by acetylating a serine residue at position 530 within the cyclooxygenase active site (Lucido et al. 2016). Acetylated PTGS2 dimer (Ac-PTGS2 dimer) changes the oxygenation stereospecificity towards its substrates, perhaps by steric shielding effects (Tosco 2013), producing a shift in lipid mediator production. Ac-PTGS2 dimer is able to incorporate molecular oxygen into ω-3 fatty acid docosahexaenoic acid (DHA), present in inflammatory exudates, to form the 17(R) epimer 17(R)-hydroperoxy-docosahexaenoic acid (17(R)-Hp-DHA) (Serhan et al. 2002, Sun et al. 2007). The product can either be transformed into aspirin-triggered D-resolvins or aspirin-triggered protectin D1 (Serhan et al. 2015).\"}]}" ;
