 4S(5)-epoxy-17(R)-HDHA to AT-RvD3 or AT-RvD4\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-9020270\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-9020270.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10092496, \"displayName\": \"LTA4H:Zn2+ hydrolyses 4S(5)-epoxy-17(R)-HDHA to AT-RvD3 or AT-RvD4\", \"inferredFrom\": [9020270], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LTA4H:Zn2+ hydrolyses 4S(5)-epoxy-17(R)-HDHA to AT-RvD3 or AT-RvD4\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9020270\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9020270.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Set\", \"dbId\": 9024570, \"displayName\": \"AT-RvD3, AT-RvD4 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 2, \"name\": [\"AT-RvD3, AT-RvD4\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9020270], \"schemaClass\": \"DefinedSet\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9024570\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9024570.1\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 9020278, \"displayName\": \"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 4(S)-Hp-17(R)-HDHA to 4S(5)-epoxy-17(R)-HDHA\", \"followingEvent\": [9020270], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 4(S)-Hp-17(R)-HDHA to 4S(5)-epoxy-17(R)-HDHA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9020278\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9020278.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9020270\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9020270.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9024573, \"displayName\": \"Leukotriene A4 hydrolase (LTA4H) is a monomeric, soluble enz...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Leukotriene A4 hydrolase (LTA4H) is a monomeric, soluble enzyme that uses a Zn2+ cofactor to catalyse the hydrolysis of the allylic epoxide leukotriene A4 (LTA4) (McGee & Fitzpatrick 1985). LTA4H can also catalyse the hydrolysis of 4S(5)-epoxy-17(R)-hydroxydocosahexaenoic acid (4S(5)-epoxy-17(R)-HDHA) to the trihydroxydocosahexaenoic acids 4(S), 11(R), 17(R)-triHDHA and 4(S), 5(R), 17(R)-triHDHA (AT-RvD3 and AT-RvD4 respectively) (Dalli et al. 2013, Serhan et al. 2002, Winkler et al. 2013, 2016). The D-resolvins are anti-inflammatory, pro-resolving, and non-phlogistic (that is, they mediate the clearance of leukocytes without eliciting an inflammatory response) (Serhan et al. 2008).\"}]}" ;
