xidises DHA to 17(S)-Hp-DHA\", \"inferredFrom\": [9020275], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX15 oxidises DHA to 17(S)-Hp-DHA\", \"4Z,7Z,10Z,13Z,16Z,19Z)-docosahexaenoate + O2 => (17S)-hydroperoxy-(4Z,7Z,10Z,13Z,15E,19Z)-docosahexaenoate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-9020275\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-9020275.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10215729, \"displayName\": \"ALOX15 oxidises DHA to 17(S)-Hp-DHA\", \"inferredFrom\": [9020275], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX15 oxidises DHA to 17(S)-Hp-DHA\", \"4Z,7Z,10Z,13Z,16Z,19Z)-docosahexaenoate + O2 => (17S)-hydroperoxy-(4Z,7Z,10Z,13Z,15E,19Z)-docosahexaenoate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-9020275\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-9020275.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10092504, \"displayName\": \"ALOX15 oxidises DHA to 17(S)-Hp-DHA\", \"inferredFrom\": [9020275], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX15 oxidises DHA to 17(S)-Hp-DHA\", \"4Z,7Z,10Z,13Z,16Z,19Z)-docosahexaenoate + O2 => (17S)-hydroperoxy-(4Z,7Z,10Z,13Z,15E,19Z)-docosahexaenoate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9020275\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9020275.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9024012, \"displayName\": \"17(S)-Hp-DHA [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"17(S)-Hp-DHA\", \"(4Z,7Z,10Z,13Z,15E,17S,19Z)-17-hydroperoxydocosahexaenoate\", \"(17S)-HPDHA(1-)\", \"(17S)-HPDoHE\", \"(4Z,7Z,10Z,13Z,15E,17S,19Z)-17-hydroperoxydocosahexaenoic acid\", \"17(S)-hydroperoxy-docosahexaenoic acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9020275], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9024012\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9024012.5\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9020275\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9020275.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9024563, \"displayName\": \"In the absence of aspirin in human whole blood, isolated leu...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"In the absence of aspirin in human whole blood, isolated leukocytes and glial cells, 15-lipoxygenase (ALOX15) can oxygenate docosahexanoic acid (DHA) (Kim et al. 1990) to the 17(S) epimer 17(S)-hydroperoxy-docosahexanoic acid (17(S)-Hp-DHA) (Hong et al. 2003). This intermediate leads to the production of 17(S) epimer D-resolvins (as opposed to aspirin-triggered 17(R) epimer D-resolvins), as well as being the precursor for protectins and the proposed precursor for the production of protectin conjugates in tissue regeneration (PCTRs) and resolvin conjugates in tissue regeneration (RCTRs) (Dalli et al. 2015, Ramon et al. 2016).\"}]}" ;
