(S)-RvE1 to 18-oxo-RvE1\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-9023968\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-9023968.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10215965, \"displayName\": \"HPGD dimer oxidises 18(S)-RvE1 to 18-oxo-RvE1\", \"inferredFrom\": [9023968], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HPGD dimer oxidises 18(S)-RvE1 to 18-oxo-RvE1\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-9023968\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-9023968.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10092752, \"displayName\": \"HPGD dimer oxidises 18(S)-RvE1 to 18-oxo-RvE1\", \"inferredFrom\": [9023968], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HPGD dimer oxidises 18(S)-RvE1 to 18-oxo-RvE1\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9023968\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9023968.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9023963, \"displayName\": \"18-oxo-RvE1 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"18-oxo-RvE1\", \"18-oxoresolvin E1(1-)\", \"18-oxoresolvin E1\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9023968], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9023963\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9023963.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 73473, \"displayName\": \"NADH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADH\", \"NADH(2-)\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9023968], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-73473\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-73473.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 9018862, \"displayName\": \"LTA4H:Zn2+ hydrolyses 5S,6S-epoxy-18(S)-HEPE to 18(S)-RvE1\", \"followingEvent\": [9023968], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LTA4H:Zn2+ hydrolyses 5S,6S-epoxy-18(S)-HEPE to 18(S)-RvE1\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9018862\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9018862.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9023968\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9023968.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9023961, \"displayName\": \"In human blood, the major metabolic products of RvE1 are 10,...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"In human blood, the major metabolic products of RvE1 are 10,11-dihydro-RvE1, 18-oxo-RvE1, and 20-hydroxy-RvE1 (Hong et al. 2008). 18-oxo-RvE1, formed by dimeric 15-hydroxyprostaglandin dehydrogenase (HPGD dimer) in the presence of NAD+, is also the major metabolite formed in murine lung and has been demonstrated to be devoid of activity, representing a mode of RvE1 inactivation (Arita et al. 2006). The exact enzymes that catalyze the formation of the other RvE1 metabolites mentioned here are currently unknown.\"}]}" ;
