+ NADH\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-9024766\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-9024766.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10092777, \"displayName\": \"HPGD dimer oxidises RvD1 to 17(S)-oxo-RvD1 and 8-oxo-17(S)-RvD1\", \"inferredFrom\": [9024766], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HPGD dimer oxidises RvD1 to 17(S)-oxo-RvD1 and 8-oxo-17(S)-RvD1\", \"NAD(+) + resolvin D1 => 17-oxoresolvin D1 + H(+) + NADH\", \"NAD(+) + resolvin D1 => 8-oxoresolvin D1 + H(+) + NADH\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9024766\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9024766.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Set\", \"dbId\": 9024799, \"displayName\": \"17(S)-oxo-RvD1, 8-oxo-17(S)-RvD1 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 2, \"name\": [\"17(S)-oxo-RvD1, 8-oxo-17(S)-RvD1\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9024766], \"schemaClass\": \"DefinedSet\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9024799\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9024799.1\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 73473, \"displayName\": \"NADH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADH\", \"NADH(2-)\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9024766], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-73473\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-73473.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 70106, \"displayName\": \"H+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\", \"proton\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9024766], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-70106\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-70106.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 9020258, \"displayName\": \"LTA4H:Zn2+ hydrolyses 7S(8)-epoxy-17(S)-HDHA to RvD1 or RvD2\", \"followingEvent\": [9024766], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LTA4H:Zn2+ hydrolyses 7S(8)-epoxy-17(S)-HDHA to RvD1 or RvD2\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9020258\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9020258.2\"}], \"previousReviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821385, \"definition\": \"structure upated after externally reviewed and then internally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"four stars\", \"name\": [\"four stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9024766\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9024766.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9024762, \"displayName\": \"Cytosolic, dimeric 15-hydroxyprostaglandin dehydrogenase (HP...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Cytosolic, dimeric 15-hydroxyprostaglandin dehydrogenase (HPGD dimer), in the presence of NAD+, can oxidise 17(S)-resolvin D1 (RvD1) to the novel metabolites 17(S)-oxo-RvD1 and 8-oxo-17(S)-RvD1. The 17(S)-oxo transformation effectively inactivates RvD1 activity whereas the 8-oxo metabolite retains most of its RvD1 activity (Sun et al. 2007).  The epimeric 17(R) aspirin-triggered form (AT-RvD1) was also found to be able to resist rapid inactivation.\"}]}" ;
