,17-HDPAn-3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"stId\": \"R-XTR-9025995\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-XTR-9025995.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10645305, \"displayName\": \"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3 to 7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3\", \"inferredFrom\": [9025995], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3 to 7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Danio rerio\", \"stId\": \"R-DRE-9025995\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DRE-9025995.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10551189, \"displayName\": \"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3 to 7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3\", \"inferredFrom\": [9025995], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3 to 7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-9025995\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-9025995.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10437780, \"displayName\": \"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3 to 7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3\", \"inferredFrom\": [9025995], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3 to 7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-9025995\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-9025995.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10323900, \"displayName\": \"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3 to 7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3\", \"inferredFrom\": [9025995], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3 to 7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-9025995\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-9025995.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10216009, \"displayName\": \"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3 to 7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3\", \"inferredFrom\": [9025995], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3 to 7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-9025995\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-9025995.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10092797, \"displayName\": \"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3 to 7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3\", \"inferredFrom\": [9025995], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3 to 7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9025995\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9025995.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9026050, \"displayName\": \"7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3\", \"7,8-epoxy,17-hydroxy-(9E,11E,13Z,15E,19Z)-docosapentaenoate\", \"7,8-epoxy,17-HDPA(n-3)(1-)\", \"7,8-epoxy,17-hydroxy-(9E,11E,13Z,15E,19Z)-docosapentaenoic acid\", \"7,8-epoxy, 17-hydroxy-omega3-docosapentaenoic acid\", \"7,8-epoxy, 17-hydroxydocosapentaenoic acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9025995], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9026050\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9026050.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29364, \"displayName\": \"NADPH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADPH\", \"NADPH(4-)\", \"TPNH\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9025995], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29364\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29364.4\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 9025996, \"displayName\": \"ALOX5 oxidises 17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3 to 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3\", \"followingEvent\": [9025995], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX5 oxidises 17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3 to 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9025996\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9025996.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9025995\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9025995.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9026045, \"displayName\": \"Instead of the dihydroperoxy intermediate being reduced, a l...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Instead of the dihydroperoxy intermediate being reduced, a lipoxygenase may mediate hydrogen abstraction from 7,17-dihydroperoxy-docosapentaenoic acid (7,17-diHp-DPAn-3) to form 7,8-epoxy, 17-hydroxydocosapentaenoic acid (7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3) (Dalli et al. 2013). Although this is a proposed biosynthetic route for the formation of DPA-n-3 resolvins, it is assumed DPAn-3-derived SPMs follow a similar synthesis route to DHA- and EPA-derived SPMs and therefore, the lipoxygenase could be the dual-functional 5-lipoxygenase (ALOX5).\"}]}" ;
