17(S)-epoxy-DPAn-3\", \"inferredFrom\": [9025999], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3 to 16(S),17(S)-epoxy-DPAn-3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9025999\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9025999.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9026046, \"displayName\": \"16(S),17(S)-epoxy-DPAn-3 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"16(S),17(S)-epoxy-DPAn-3\", \"(16S,17S)-epoxy-(7Z,10Z,12E,14E,19Z)-docosapentaenoate\", \"16(S),17(S)-epoxy-DPA(n-3)(1-)\", \"(16S,17S)-epoxy-(7Z,10Z,12E,14E,19Z)-docosapentaenoic acid\", \"16(S),17(S)-epoxy-omega3-docosapentaenoic acid\", \"16(S),17(S)-epoxy-docosapentaenoic acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9025999], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9026046\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9026046.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29364, \"displayName\": \"NADPH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADPH\", \"NADPH(4-)\", \"TPNH\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9025999], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29364\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29364.4\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 9026003, \"displayName\": \"ALOX15 oxidises DPAn-3 to 17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3\", \"followingEvent\": [9025999], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX15 oxidises DPAn-3 to 17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9026003\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9026003.3\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9025999\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9025999.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9026032, \"displayName\": \"In neutrophils, an unknown lipoxygenase may mediate hydrogen...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"In neutrophils, an unknown lipoxygenase may mediate hydrogen abstraction from 17(S)-hydroperoxy-docosapentaenoic acid (17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3) to form 16(S),17(S)-epoxy-docosapentaenoic acid (16(S),17(S)-epoxy-DPAn-3) (Dalli et al. 2013). If, as assumed, DPA metabolism follows the same path as DHA metabolism, the lipoxygenase could be the dual-functional 5-lipoxygenase (ALOX5). The formation of this epoxy intermediate is supported by chemical synthesis experiments (Aursnes et al. 2014, Primdahl et al. 2017).\"}]}" ;
