tures and actions\", \"journal\": \"Sci Rep\", \"pages\": \"1940\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 23736886, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Novel n-3 immunoresolvents: structures and actions\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/23736886\", \"volume\": 3, \"year\": 2013}], \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Hydroperoxy reductase reduces 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3 to RvD5n-3DPA\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9026036, \"displayName\": \"RvD5n-3DPA [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"RvD5n-3DPA\", \"7,17-dihydroxy-(8Z,15E,19Z)-docosa-8,10,13,15,19-pentaenoate\", \"RvD5n-3 DPA(1-)\", \"7,17-dihydroxy-(8Z,15E,19Z)-docosa-8,10,13,15,19-pentaenoic acid\", \"7,17-dihydroxy-omega3-docosapentaenoic acid\", \"DPAn-3 resolvin D5\", \"7,17-dihydroxy-omega-3-docosapentaenoic acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9026001], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9026036\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9026036.5\"}, {\"className\": \"OtherEntity\", \"dbId\": 9024637, \"displayName\": \"oxidised acceptor [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"oxidised acceptor\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9026001], \"schemaClass\": \"OtherEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9024637\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9024637.2\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 9025996, \"displayName\": \"ALOX5 oxidises 17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3 to 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3\", \"followingEvent\": [9026001], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX5 oxidises 17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3 to 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9025996\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9025996.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9026001\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9026001.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9026033, \"displayName\": \"A hydroperoxy reductase probably reduces 7,17-dihydroperoxy-...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"A hydroperoxy reductase probably reduces 7,17-dihydroperoxy-docosapentaenoic acid (7,17-diHp-DPAn-3) to the resolvin 7,17-dihydroxy-docosapentaenoic acid (RvD5n-3DPA) (Dalli et al. 2013). Treatment with RvD5n-3DPA reduced colitis and intestinal ischemia/reperfusion-induced inflammation in mice and reduced human neutrophil-endothelial cell interactions with TNF-α-activated human endothelial monolayers (Gobbetti et al. 2017). Although this is a proposed biosynthetic route for the formation of DPA-n-3 resolvins, it is assumed DPAn-3-derived SPMs follow a similar synthesis route to DHA- and EPA-derived SPMs.\"}]}" ;
