ass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Novel n-3 immunoresolvents: structures and actions\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/23736886\", \"volume\": 3, \"year\": 2013}, {\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 9026026, \"displayName\": \"Stereocontrolled synthesis and investigation of the biosynthetic transformations of 16(S),17(S)-epoxy-PDn-3 DPA\", \"journal\": \"Org. Biomol. Chem.\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 28980694, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Stereocontrolled synthesis and investigation of the biosynthetic transformations of 16(S),17(S)-epoxy-PDn-3 DPA\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/28980694\", \"year\": 2017}, {\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 9026037, \"displayName\": \"Total synthesis of the lipid mediator PD1n-3 DPA: configurational assignments and anti-inflammatory and pro-resolving actions\", \"journal\": \"J. Nat. Prod.\", \"pages\": \"910-6\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 24576195, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Total synthesis of the lipid mediator PD1n-3 DPA: configurational assignments and anti-inflammatory and pro-resolving actions\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/24576195\", \"volume\": 77, \"year\": 2014}], \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX15 oxidises DPAn-3 to 17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3\"], \"orthologousEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 11051156, \"displayName\": \"ALOX15 oxidises DPAn-3 to 17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3\", \"inferredFrom\": [9026003], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX15 oxidises DPAn-3 to 17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Dictyostelium discoideum\", \"stId\": \"R-DDI-9026003\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DDI-9026003.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10645311, \"displayName\": \"ALOX15 oxidises DPAn-3 to 17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3\", \"inferredFrom\"