"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-9026003\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-9026003.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10092803, \"displayName\": \"ALOX15 oxidises DPAn-3 to 17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3\", \"inferredFrom\": [9026003], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX15 oxidises DPAn-3 to 17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9026003\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9026003.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9026047, \"displayName\": \"17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3\", \"(7Z,10Z,13Z,15E,17S,19Z)-17-hydroperoxydocosapentaenoate\", \"17(S)-HpDoPE(n-3)(1-)\", \"(7Z,10Z,13Z,15E,17S,19Z)-17-hydroperoxydocosapentaenoic acid\", \"17(S)-hydroperoxy-omega3-docosapentaenoic acid\", \"17(S)-hydroperoxy-docosapentaenoic acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9026003], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9026047\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9026047.5\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9026003\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9026003.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9026038, \"displayName\": \"At sites of injury, 15 lipoxygenase (ALOX15) can oxygenate ω...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"At sites of injury, 15 lipoxygenase (ALOX15) can oxygenate ω-3 docosapentaenoic acid (DPAn-3) to form the 17(S) epimer 17(S)-hydroperoxy docosapentaenoic acid (17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3) in neutrophils (Dalli et al. 2013). The formations of individual hydroperoxy intermediates are supported by chemical synthesis experiments (Aursnes et al. 2014, Primdahl et al. 2017) and are the pivotal intermediates in the production of DPAn-3 derived protectins and resolvins.\"}]}" ;
