ocosapentaenoic acid\", \"14(S)-hydroperoxy-docosapentaenoic acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9026006], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9026293\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9026293.5\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9026006\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9026006.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9026310, \"displayName\": \"In a parallel pathway to 15-lipoxygenase-initiated protectin...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"In a parallel pathway to 15-lipoxygenase-initiated protectin formation from ω-3 docosapentaenoic acid (DPAn-3), 12-lipoxygenase can also oxygenate DPAn-3 to form 14(S)-hydroperoxy-docosapentaenoic acid (14(S)-Hp-DPAn-3) (Dalli et al. 2013). This intermediate is the precursor for DPA-n-3-derived maresins.\"}]}" ;
