 resolvins that increase with atorvastatin and clear infections\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/26236990\", \"volume\": 21, \"year\": 2015}, {\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 9026414, \"displayName\": \"Synthesis of 13(R)-Hydroxy-7Z,10Z,13R,14E,16Z,19Z Docosapentaenoic Acid (13R-HDPA) and Its Biosynthetic Conversion to the 13-Series Resolvins\", \"journal\": \"J. Nat. Prod.\", \"pages\": \"2693-2702\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 27704804, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Synthesis of 13(R)-Hydroxy-7Z,10Z,13R,14E,16Z,19Z Docosapentaenoic Acid (13R-HDPA) and Its Biosynthetic Conversion to the 13-Series Resolvins\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/27704804\", \"volume\": 79, \"year\": 2016}], \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"13(R)-HDPAn-3 translocates from endothelial cell to neutrophil\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9026400, \"displayName\": \"13(R)-HDPAn-3 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"13(R)-HDPAn-3\", \"(7Z,10Z,13R,14E,16Z,19Z)-13-hydroxydocosapentaenoate\", \"13(R)-hydroxy-docosapentaenoic acid\", \"(7Z,10Z,13R,14E,16Z,19Z)-13-hydroxydocosapentaenoic acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9026411], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9026400\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9026400.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 9026408, \"displayName\": \"PTGS2 dimer oxidises DPAn-3 to 13(R)-HDPAn-3\", \"followingEvent\": [9026411], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PTGS2 dimer oxidises DPAn-3 to 13(R)-HDPAn-3\", \"(7Z,10Z,13Z,16Z,19Z)-docosapentaenoate + AH2 + O2 => 13R-hydroxy-(7Z,10Z,14E,16Z,19Z)-docosapentaenoate + A + H2O\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9026408\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9026408.4\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"BlackBoxEvent\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9026411\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9026411.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9026404, \"displayName\": \"13(R)-hydroxy-docosapentaenoic acid (13(R)-DPAn-3) transloca...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"13(R)-hydroxy-docosapentaenoic acid (13(R)-DPAn-3) translocates from endothelial cells to adhered neutrophils, where it can be oxidised further (Dalli et al. 2015, Primdahl et al. 2016).\"}]}" ;
