oxy-DHA to form MCTR1\", \"(13S,14S)-epoxy-(4Z,7Z,9E,11E,16Z,19Z)-docosahexaenoate + glutathione => (13R)-S-glutathionyl-(14S)-hydroxy-(4Z,7Z,9E,11E,16Z,19Z)-docosahexaenoate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-9026777\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-9026777.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10092817, \"displayName\": \"GSTM4 dimer transfers GSH to 13(S),14(S)-epoxy-DHA to form MCTR1\", \"inferredFrom\": [9026777], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"GSTM4 dimer transfers GSH to 13(S),14(S)-epoxy-DHA to form MCTR1\", \"(13S,14S)-epoxy-(4Z,7Z,9E,11E,16Z,19Z)-docosahexaenoate + glutathione => (13R)-S-glutathionyl-(14S)-hydroxy-(4Z,7Z,9E,11E,16Z,19Z)-docosahexaenoate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9026777\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9026777.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9026761, \"displayName\": \"MCTR1 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"MCTR1\", \"(13R)-S-glutathionyl-(14S)-hydroxy-(4Z,7Z,9E,11E,16Z,19Z)-docosahexaenoate(2-)\", \"MCTR1(2-)\", \"13(R)-glutathionyl, 14(S)-hydroxy-4Z,7Z,9E,11E,13R,14S,16Z,19Z-docosahexaenoic acid\", \"(13R)-S-glutathionyl-(14S)-hydroxy-(4Z,7Z,9E,11E,16Z,19Z)-docosahexaenoic acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9026777], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9026761\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9026761.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 9024983, \"displayName\": \"ALOX12:Fe2+ dehydrogenates 14(S)-Hp-DHA to 13(S),14(S)-epoxy-DHA\", \"followingEvent\": [9026777], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX12:Fe2+ dehydrogenates 14(S)-Hp-DHA to 13(S),14(S)-epoxy-DHA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9024983\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9024983.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9026777\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9026777.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9026759, \"displayName\": \"Cytosolic, dimeric glutathione S-transferase Mu 4 (GSTM4 dim...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Cytosolic, dimeric glutathione S-transferase Mu 4 (GSTM4 dimer) can catalyse the transfer of a glutathionyl group from glutathione (GSH) to 13(S),14(S)-epoxy-docosahexaenoic acid (13(S),14(S)-epoxy-DHA) to form maresin conjugate in tissue regeneration 1 (MCTR1) (Dalli et al. 2014, 2016a, 2016b). MCTR1, given to mice with E. coli peritonitis, showed potent proresolving action in inflammation and infections. With human macrophages, MCTR1 stimulated efferocytosis of apoptotic cells (Dalli et al. 2014).\"}]}" ;
