t\": \"In an alternative route to PCTR production, 17(S)-hydroperoxy-docosahexaenoic acid (17(S)-Hp-DHA) can undergo a second lipoxygenation at carbon 7 position to yield 7S,17S-dihydroperoxy-docosahexaenoic acid (7(S),17(S)-diHp-DHA). A lipoxygenase mediates this reaction although the exact human enzyme is unknown (Dalli et al. 2015).\"}]}" ;
