, \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9027043\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9027043.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9027049, \"displayName\": \"14(R)-HDHA [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"14(R)-HDHA\", \"(14R)-HDoHE(1-)\", \"(14R)-HDHA(1-)\", \"14(R)-hydroxy-docosahexaenoic acid\", \"(14R)-HDoHE\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9027043], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9027049\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9027049.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29356, \"displayName\": \"H2O [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H2O\", \"water\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9027043], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29356\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29356.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29366, \"displayName\": \"NADP+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADP+\", \"NADP(3-)\", \"NADP\", \"NADP(+)\", \"Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"beta-Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"TPN\", \"Triphosphopyridine nucleotide\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9027043], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29366\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29366.5\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9027043\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9027043.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9027050, \"displayName\": \"Using human leukocytes and platelets, Hong et al. found that...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Using human leukocytes and platelets, Hong et al. found that incubating docosahexaenoic acid (DHA) with a mixture of human cytochrome P450 enzymes (CYP1A2, 2C8, 2C9, 2D6, 2E1 and 3A4) formed 14(R)-hydroxy-docsosahexaenoic acid (14(R)-HDHA), the precursor to maresin-like mediator 2 (MaR-L2) (Hong et al. 2014). There is no data to indicate which one or ones of these CYPs mediate this event under physiological conditions. CYP inhibition diminishes the formation of 14(R)-HDHA, confirming CYP determines 14(R)-hydroxylation (Hong et al. 2014). The CYP mixture also formed 22-hydroxy-docosahexaenoic acid (22-HDHA) by ω-oxidation (not shown here). Although the CYP mixture also catalysed the formation of 14(S)-HDHA, the amount formed is minor compared to that formed by 12-lipoxygenase (Hong et al. 2014).\"}]}" ;
