cts, maresins (MaR1, MaR2...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"To produce their pro-resolving effects, maresins (MaR1, MaR2, 7(S), 14(S)-diHDHA and 7-epi-MaR1) are released into the exudate of local inflammation sites (Serhan et al. 2015). The mechanism of translocation is unknown.\"}]}" ;
