\"Science\", \"pages\": \"1171-6\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 2820055, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Leukotrienes and lipoxins: structures, biosynthesis, and biological effects\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/2820055\", \"volume\": 237, \"year\": 1987}], \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LTA4 translocates from neutrophil cytosol to platelet cytosol\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9032038, \"displayName\": \"LTA4 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LTA4\", \"leukotriene A4(1-)\", \"leukotriene A4\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9032036], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9032038\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9032038.4\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 266051, \"displayName\": \"5S-HpETE is dehydrated to LTA4 by ALOX5\", \"followingEvent\": [9032036], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"5S-HpETE is dehydrated to LTA4 by ALOX5\", \"(5S)-hydroperoxy-(6E,8Z,11Z,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate => H2O + leukotriene A4\", \"Dehydration of 5-HpETE to leukotriene A4\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2008-12-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-266051\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-266051.4\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2018-03-21\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"BlackBoxEvent\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9032036\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9032036.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9032037, \"displayName\": \"Leukotriene A4 (LTA4), produced by 5-lipoxygenase (ALOX5) in...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Leukotriene A4 (LTA4), produced by 5-lipoxygenase (ALOX5) in neutrophils, can be taken up by platelets where it is acted upon by 12-lipoxygenase (ALOX12) to form lipoxins (Samuelsson et al. 1987). The mechanism of translocation is unknown.\"}]}" ;
