", \"title\": \"Binding thermodynamics of statins to HMG-CoA reductase\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/16128575\", \"volume\": 44, \"year\": 2005}, {\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 9705573, \"displayName\": \"An Atomic-Level Perspective of HMG-CoA-Reductase: The Target Enzyme to Treat Hypercholesterolemia\", \"journal\": \"Molecules\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 32859023, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"An Atomic-Level Perspective of HMG-CoA-Reductase: The Target Enzyme to Treat Hypercholesterolemia\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/32859023\", \"volume\": 25, \"year\": 2020}, {\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 9705579, \"displayName\": \"Structural mechanism for statin inhibition of 3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl coenzyme A reductase\", \"journal\": \"Am Heart J\", \"pages\": \"S27-32\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 12486413, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Structural mechanism for statin inhibition of 3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl coenzyme A reductase\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/12486413\", \"volume\": 144, \"year\": 2002}, {\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 9705572, \"displayName\": \"Structural mechanism for statin inhibition of HMG-CoA reductase\", \"journal\": \"Science\", \"pages\": \"1160-4\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 11349148, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Structural mechanism for statin inhibition of HMG-CoA reductase\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/11349148\", \"volume\": 292, \"year\": 2001}], \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HMGCR dimer binds statins\"], \"orthologousEvent\": [{\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10327012, \"displayName\": \"HMGCR dimer binds statins\", \"inferredFrom\": [9705584], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HMGCR dimer binds statins\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reactio