e-dependent inhibition of human farnesyl pyrophosphate synthase and blockade of mevalonate pathway by nitrogen-containing bisphosphonates in cultured cells\", \"journal\": \"Biochem Biophys Res Commun\", \"pages\": \"663-7\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 21420384, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Correlation between time-dependent inhibition of human farnesyl pyrophosphate synthase and blockade of mevalonate pathway by nitrogen-containing bisphosphonates in cultured cells\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21420384\", \"volume\": 407, \"year\": 2011}, {\"className\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"dbId\": 9717973, \"displayName\": \"Synthesis, chiral high performance liquid chromatographic resolution and enantiospecific activity of a potent new geranylgeranyl transferase inhibitor, 2-hydroxy-3-imidazo[1,2-a]pyridin-3-yl-2-phosphonopropionic acid\", \"journal\": \"J Med Chem\", \"pages\": \"3454-64\", \"pubMedIdentifier\": 20394422, \"schemaClass\": \"LiteratureReference\", \"title\": \"Synthesis, chiral high performance liquid chromatographic resolution and enantiospecific activity of a potent new geranylgeranyl transferase inhibitor, 2-hydroxy-3-imidazo[1,2-a]pyridin-3-yl-2-phosphonopropionic acid\", \"url\": \"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/20394422\", \"volume\": 53, \"year\": 2010}], \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"holo-FDPS dimer binds FDPS inhibitors\"], \"orthologousEvent\": [{\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10327954, \"displayName\": \"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"inferredFrom\": [9717841], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"holo-FDPS dimer binds FDPS inhibitors\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-9717841\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-9717841.1\"}, {\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 11134251, \"displayName\": \"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"inferredFrom\": [9717841], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"holo-FDPS dimer binds FDPS inhibitors\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Plasmodium falciparum\", \"stId\": \"R-PFA-9717841\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-PFA-9717841.1\"}, {\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 11113253, \"displayName\": \"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"inferredFrom\": [9717841], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"holo-FDPS dimer binds FDPS inhibitors\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Saccharomyces cerevisiae\", \"stId\": \"R-SCE-9717841\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SCE-9717841.1\"}, {\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 11084146, \"displayName\": \"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"inferredFrom\": [9717841], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"holo-FDPS dimer binds FDPS inhibitors\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Schizosaccharomyces pombe\", \"stId\": \"R-SPO-9717841\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SPO-9717841.1\"}, {\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 11053908, \"displayName\": \"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"inferredFrom\": [9717841], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"holo-FDPS dimer binds FDPS inhibitors\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Dictyostelium discoideum\", \"stId\": \"R-DDI-9717841\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DDI-9717841.1\"}, {\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10996647, \"displayName\": \"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"inferredFrom\": [9717841], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"holo-FDPS dimer binds FDPS inhibitors\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Caenorhabditis elegans\", \"stId\": \"R-CEL-9717841\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CEL-9717841.1\"}, {\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10912471, \"displayName\": \"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"inferredFrom\": [9717841], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"holo-FDPS dimer binds FDPS inhibitors\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Drosophila melanogaster\", \"stId\": \"R-DME-9717841\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DME-9717841.1\"}, {\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10826177, \"displayName\": \"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"inferredFrom\": [9717841], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"holo-FDPS dimer binds FDPS inhibitors\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Gallus gallus\", \"stId\": \"R-GGA-9717841\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-GGA-9717841.1\"}, {\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10648189, \"displayName\": \"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"inferredFrom\": [9717841], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"holo-FDPS dimer binds FDPS inhibitors\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Danio rerio\", \"stId\": \"R-DRE-9717841\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DRE-9717841.1\"}, {\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10555413, \"displayName\": \"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"inferredFrom\": [9717841], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"holo-FDPS dimer binds FDPS inhibitors\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-9717841\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-9717841.1\"}, {\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10220515, \"displayName\": \"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"inferredFrom\": [9717841], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"holo-FDPS dimer binds FDPS inhibitors\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-9717841\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-9717841.1\"}, {\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10097283, \"displayName\": \"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"inferredFrom\": [9717841], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"holo-FDPS dimer binds NBPs\", \"holo-FDPS dimer binds FDPS inhibitors\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9717841\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9717841.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Complex\", \"dbId\": 9717836, \"displayName\": \"holo-FDPS dimer:NBPs [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"isChimeric\": false, \"maxDepth\": 4, \"name\": [\"holo-FDPS dimer:NBPs\", \"holo-FDPS dimer:FDPS inhibitors\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9717841], \"schemaClass\": \"Complex\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9717836\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9717836.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2022-06-09\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9717841\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9717841.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9717972, \"displayName\": \"The mevalonate pathway is responsible for the biosynthesis o...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"The mevalonate pathway is responsible for the biosynthesis of all isoprenoids, metabolites that are vital for normal cellular functions. Two key isoprenoids, farnesyl pyrophosphate (FPP) and geranylgeranyl pyrophosphate (GGPP) are responsible for the post-translational prenylation of small GTP-binding proteins, and serve as the biosynthetic precursors to numerous other biomolecules. The downstream metabolite of FPP and GGPP is squalene, the precursor to steroids, bile acids, lipoproteins, and vitamin D.<br><br>Nitrogen-containing bisphosphonates (NBPs) are drugs used to treat diseases characterized by excessive bone resorption such as Paget's disease of bone, bone metastases, multiple myeloma (Simoni et al. 2008), and osteoporosis. NBPs act by inhibiting farnesyl pyrophosphate synthase (FDPS) involved in the mevalonate pathway (Bergstrom et al. 2000, Dunford et al. 2001, Dunford et al. 2008, Räikkönen et al. 2011). Inhibition of FDPS in osteoclasts prevents the biosynthesis of the isoprenoid lipids FPP and GGPP, which are essential for the post-translational farnesylation and geranylgeranylation of small GTPase signalling proteins. Loss of bone-resorptive activity and osteoclast apoptosis is primarily due to the loss of geranylgeranylated small GTPases (Review - Cremers et al. 2019). Approved NBPs include the second generation NBPs pamidronic acid and alendronic acid and the third generation NBPs ibandronic acid, zoledronic acid, minodronic acid and risedronate.\"}]}" ;
