AP is cleaved\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"BlackBoxEvent\", \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-9840334\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-9840334.1\"}, {\"category\": \"omitted\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10330852, \"displayName\": \"PSAP is cleaved\", \"inferredFrom\": [9840334], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PSAP is cleaved\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"BlackBoxEvent\", \"speciesName\": \"Canis familiaris\", \"stId\": \"R-CFA-9840334\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CFA-9840334.1\"}, {\"category\": \"omitted\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10223620, \"displayName\": \"PSAP is cleaved\", \"inferredFrom\": [9840334], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PSAP is cleaved\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"BlackBoxEvent\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-9840334\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-9840334.1\"}, {\"category\": \"omitted\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10100240, \"displayName\": \"PSAP is cleaved\", \"inferredFrom\": [9840334], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PSAP is cleaved\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"BlackBoxEvent\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9840334\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9840334.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Protein\", \"dbId\": 9840336, \"displayName\": \"PSAP(195-273) [lysosomal lumen]\", \"endCoordinate\": 273, \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PSAP(195-273)\", \"SAP B\", \"Saposin-B\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9840334], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceGeneProduct\", \"schemaClass\": \"EntityWithAccessionedSequence\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9840336\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9840336.1\", \"startCoordinate\": 195}, {\"className\": \"Protein\", \"dbId\": 1605602, \"displayName\": \"PSAP(311-391) [lysosomal membrane]\", \"endCoordinate\": 391, \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PSAP(311-391)\", \"SAPC\", \"Saposin-C\", \"SAP-2\", \"Proactivator polypeptide  component recommendedName: Saposin-A\", \"PSAP\", \"SAP_HUMAN\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9840334], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceGeneProduct\", \"schemaClass\": \"EntityWithAccessionedSequence\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-1605602\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-1605602.1\", \"startCoordinate\": 311}, {\"className\": \"Protein\", \"dbId\": 9840328, \"displayName\": \"PSAP(405-486) [lysosomal lumen]\", \"endCoordinate\": 486, \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PSAP(405-486)\", \"SAP D\", \"Saposin-D\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9840334], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceGeneProduct\", \"schemaClass\": \"EntityWithAccessionedSequence\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9840328\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9840328.1\", \"startCoordinate\": 405}, {\"className\": \"Protein\", \"dbId\": 351333, \"displayName\": \"PSAP(60-142) [lysosomal lumen]\", \"endCoordinate\": 142, \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PSAP(60-142)\", \"SAP A\", \"Saposin-A\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9840334], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceGeneProduct\", \"schemaClass\": \"EntityWithAccessionedSequence\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-351333\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-351333.2\", \"startCoordinate\": 60}], \"releaseDate\": \"2023-09-13\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"BlackBoxEvent\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9840334\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9840334.3\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9840330, \"displayName\": \"After its transport to lysosomes, prosaposin (PSAP) gets cle...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"After its transport to lysosomes, prosaposin (PSAP) gets cleaved by unknown proteases into the fragments PSAP(60-142) (Saposin A), PSAP(195-273) (Saposin B), PSAP(311-391) (Saposin C) and PSAP(405-486) (Saposin D). Intermediate polyproteins during cleavage appear to be B-C-D, B-C, and C-D (Furst et al., 1988; Leonova et al., 1996; saposins were reviewed by O'Brien & Kishimoto, 1991; Morales et al., 1995; Kolter et al., 2005: Kolter & Sandhoff, 2010; Garrido-Arandia et al., 2018). Bioinformatics suggests that different peptidases, including trypsin, may be responsible for cleavage at different PSAP cleavage sites. In its dimerized form PSAP(195-273) (Saposin B) is centrally involved in mobilizing glycosphingolipids for catabolism, while PSAP(60-142) (Saposin A) and PSAP(405-486) (Saposin D) activate GALC and ASAH1, respectively.\"}]}" ;
