 \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-9844587\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-9844587.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10100919, \"displayName\": \"GAL3ST1 transfers sulfate to GalCer,LacCer\", \"inferredFrom\": [9844587], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"GAL3ST1 transfers sulfate to GalCer,LacCer\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9844587\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9844587.1\"}], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 742343, \"displayName\": \"PAP [Golgi lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PAP\", \"adenosine 3',5'-bismonophosphate(4-)\", \"adenosine 3',5'-bisphosphate\", \"adenosine 3',5'-bismonophosphate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9844587], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-742343\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-742343.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 425969, \"displayName\": \"H+ [Golgi lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9844587], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-425969\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-425969.3\"}, {\"className\": \"Set\", \"dbId\": 9845488, \"displayName\": \"SM3,SM4 [Golgi membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 2, \"name\": [\"SM3,SM4\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9844587], \"schemaClass\": \"DefinedSet\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9845488\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9845488.1\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 6785933, \"displayName\": \"UGT8 transfers Gal from UDP-Gal to CERA\", \"followingEvent\": [9844587], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"UGT8 transfers Gal from UDP-Gal to CERA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2015-12-15\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-6785933\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-6785933.4\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 9851347, \"displayName\": \"B4GALT5/6 transfer Gal to GlcCer\", \"followingEvent\": [9844587], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"B4GALT5/6 transfer Gal to GlcCer\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2023-12-06\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9851347\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9851347.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2023-12-06\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9844587\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9844587.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9844581, \"displayName\": \"Galactosylceramide sulfotransferase (GAL3ST1, CST) catalyzes...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Galactosylceramide sulfotransferase (GAL3ST1, CST) catalyzes the transfer of sulfate from phosphoadenylylsulfate (PAPS) onto position 3 of beta-galactosyl residues in glycerolipids and sphingolipids yielding sulfogalactoceramide (sulfatide) or sulfo-LacCer (SM3), and adenosine-3',5'-bisphosphate (Honke et al., 1996, 1997). Sulfatides are abundant but not essential in the myelin sheath. GAL3ST1 deficiency leads to the arrest of spermatogenesis. It ameliorates L-selectin-dependent monocyte infiltration in renal interstitial inflammation, indicating that sulfatide is an endogenous ligand of L-selectin (reviewed by Honke, 2013).\"}]}" ;
