CMP [Golgi lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CMP\", \"cytidine 5'-monophosphate(2-)\", \"cytidine 5'-monophosphate\", \"cytidylic acid\", \"Cytidine-5'-monophosphate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9846305], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-727810\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-727810.6\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 425969, \"displayName\": \"H+ [Golgi lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9846305], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-425969\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-425969.3\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 9845538, \"displayName\": \"ST3GAL2,3 transfer Neu5Ac to gangliosides\", \"followingEvent\": [9846305], \"isChimeric\": false, \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ST3GAL2,3 transfer Neu5Ac to gangliosides\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2023-12-06\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9845538\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9845538.2\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2023-12-06\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9846305\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9846305.2\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9846311, \"displayName\": \"Alpha-2,6-sialyltransferases 5 and 6 (ST6GALNAC5,6) transfer...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Alpha-2,6-sialyltransferases 5 and 6 (ST6GALNAC5,6) transfer a sialic acid (Neu5Ac) moiety to the terminal N-acetylgalactosaminyl (GalNAc) residue of ganglioside GM1b to produce ganglioside GD1alpha (GD1α). Neu5Ac is added to GalNAc-R via an alpha-2,6 linkage (Ikehara et al. 1999, Tsuchida et al. 2003). To date, the specific function of α-series gangliosides is poorly understood.\"}]}" ;
