icosatrieno...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Epoxide hydrolase 2 (EPHX2) hydrolyses 8,9-epoxyeicosatrienoate (5,6-EET) to 8,9-dihydroxyeicosatrienoate(5,6-DHET) (Werner et al. 2002; Gomez et al. 2004).  The majority of the EET biological activities are diminished by this hydrolysis.\"}]}" ;
