adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"TPN\", \"Triphosphopyridine nucleotide\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9915997], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29366\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29366.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29356, \"displayName\": \"H2O [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H2O\", \"water\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9915997], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29356\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29356.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 2142792, \"displayName\": \"14,15-EET [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"14,15-EET\", \"14,15-EET(1-)\"], \"producedByEvent\": [9915997], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-2142792\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-2142792.3\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 428990, \"displayName\": \"SLC27A1 transports arachidonate across the ER membrane\", \"followingEvent\": [9915997], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"SLC27A1 transports arachidonate across the ER membrane\", \"(5Z,8Z,11Z,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate(out) = (5Z,8Z,11Z,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate(in)\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2012-12-04\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-428990\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-428990.5\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2024-09-11\", \"reviewStatus\": {\"className\": \"ReviewStatus\", \"dbId\": 9821382, \"definition\": \"externally reviewed\", \"displayName\": \"five stars\", \"name\": [\"five stars\"], \"schemaClass\": \"ReviewStatus\"}, \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"HSA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48887, \"displayName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"name\": [\"Homo sapiens\", \"H. sapiens\", \"Hs\", \"human\", \"man\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9606\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Homo sapiens\", \"stId\": \"R-HSA-9915997\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-HSA-9915997.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9915970, \"displayName\": \"Several cytochrome P450s (CYPs) convert arachidonate to 14,1...\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Several cytochrome P450s (CYPs) convert arachidonate to 14,15-epoxyeicosatrienoate (14,15-EET). The CYPs and their references are: CYP1A1, CYP1A2, CYP1B1 (Choudhary et al. 2004); CYP2C8, CYP2C9 (Rifkind et al. 1995); CYP2C19 (Bylund et al. 1998, Rifkind et al. 1995); CYP2J2 (Wu et al. 1996).\"}]}" ;
