4) from arachidonate in a two-step process.  First, arachidonic acid AA is oxidized to form 5S-hydroperoxyeicosatetranoic acid (5S-HpETE) (Rouzer et al. 1988, Rouzer & Samuelsson 1987, Rouzer et al. 1986).\"}]}" ;
